01:24:24,220 --> 01:24:25,900
Okay, doesn't look like there's anything else.

1363
01:24:29,920 --> 01:24:42,100
I do wonder, if you go down into the lava with fire protection on, and I'm talking deep enough, if there's only lava-type enemies that spawn in the lava.

1364
01:24:42,580 --> 01:24:44,840
You know, like some kind of lava fish.

1365
01:24:45,760 --> 01:24:52,080
I'm pretty sure it doesn't happen in the nether, because I've already sort of swam around there quite a bit, but in this place, who knows?

1366
01:24:52,780 --> 01:24:54,100
I never really tried it.

1367
01:25:02,040 --> 01:25:03,260
I need to go ahead and use this.

1368
01:25:14,820 --> 01:25:15,240
See?

1369
01:25:15,380 --> 01:25:15,800
Enemies here.

1370
01:25:17,040 --> 01:25:19,020
That means I have not lit it properly.

1371
01:25:26,360 --> 01:25:27,040
Please die.

1372
01:25:28,320 --> 01:25:32,660
See, he spawned over there in this little patch of darkness that I left.

1373
01:25:33,880 --> 01:25:34,380
Unbelievable.

1374
01:25:34,680 --> 01:25:36,200
Okay, it was quite a big patch, I guess.

1375
01:25:37,040 --> 01:25:38,020
I take it back.

1376
01:25:39,080 --> 01:25:41,800
And you spawned down there.

1377
01:25:47,160 --> 01:25:52,060
I actually... I feel like I am becoming, like, really knowledgeable with Minecraft.

1378
01:25:53,420 --> 01:25:54,200
Know what I mean?

1379
01:25:54,280 --> 01:25:57,260
Like, compare my knowledge now to when I first started Minecraft.

1380
01:25:57,880 --> 01:25:59,900
I am like a god at this point.

1381
01:26:00,180 --> 01:26:02,220
Manipulating the world itself, you know?

1382
01:26:02,600 --> 01:26:04,320
I'm pretty much terraforming Mars.

1383
01:26:06,040 --> 01:26:07,480
But, like, with meta stuff.

1384
01:26:08,060 --> 01:26:10,200
Such as spawn mechanics and all that shit.

1385
01:26:17,820 --> 01:26:20,660
Oh yeah, this entire tunnel needs to get lit up.

1386
01:26:23,380 --> 01:26:34,280
I'm constantly listening to... for potential enemies... in other caves... close to me.

1387
01:26:37,500 --> 01:26:38,800
Nice, that loops back here.

1388
01:26:39,040 --> 01:26:39,460
Interesting.

1389
01:26:41,340 --> 01:26:43,760
This entire place was completely dark just before.

1390
01:26:44,680 --> 01:26:45,620
And now it's not.

1391
01:26:46,000 --> 01:26:46,680
Oh, missed a spot.

1392
01:26:48,260 --> 01:26:51,520
And remember, this spot right here is right below the village.

1393
01:26:52,240 --> 01:26:55,360
So lighting this place has a huge effect.

1394
01:26:59,280 --> 01:27:00,200
Okay, that's lava.

1395
01:27:02,920 --> 01:27:04,120
Oh my god, I got a drink.

1396
01:27:04,380 --> 01:27:04,980
Cheers, everybody.

1397
01:27:09,000 --> 01:27:12,220
Fuck, man, that quesadilla was something else.

1398
01:27:12,980 --> 01:27:14,240
Let me tell you what I put in it.

1399
01:27:15,280 --> 01:27:19,440
So I had some ground beef on the pan.

1400
01:27:19,860 --> 01:27:21,200
Bunch of spices, you know.

1401
01:27:21,820 --> 01:27:22,820
Bit of oil, of course.

1402
01:27:23,920 --> 01:27:26,840
And then I did... then I had the Tex-Mex cheese.

1403
01:27:27,780 --> 01:27:29,000
I had the beans.

1404
01:27:30,440 --> 01:27:33,780
And I had some maize, I guess you... corn, I guess you call it.

1405
01:27:33,840 --> 01:27:34,940
And then I had corn tortillas.

1406
01:27:35,600 --> 01:27:36,000
Right?

1407
01:27:37,000 --> 01:27:39,660
So I took all that and I mixed it together.

1408
01:27:39,920 --> 01:27:46,480
And then I put it on the tortilla on the pan and then flipped it, you know, almost like a... Well, like a quesadilla, I guess.

1409
01:27:46,600 --> 01:27:49,720
It's just that I would never use that as an analogy because it's the first time I've had it, right?

1410
01:27:50,560 --> 01:27:51,660
My goodness, it was good.

1411
01:27:52,540 --> 01:27:54,380
What a wonderful experience that was.

1412
01:27:55,360 --> 01:27:57,100
Lifted my spirits more than you can imagine.

1413
01:27:59,300 --> 01:28:00,440
I'm going to go up one level now.

1414
01:28:01,520 --> 01:28:01,840
Ascension.

1415
01:28:02,040 --> 01:28:02,620
Oh, I need to eat.

1416
01:28:07,590 --> 01:28:08,110
There we go.

1417
01:28:09,250 --> 01:28:10,070
This is way too dark.

1418
01:28:10,930 --> 01:28:11,530
Darkness alert!

1419
01:28:14,110 --> 01:28:16,490
That's the alert for the darkness.

1420
01:28:19,270 --> 01:28:20,550
Okay, ran out of torches again.

1421
01:28:21,810 --> 01:28:25,130
Honestly, kind of satisfying to run out of torches because it means I did a lot of work.

1422
01:28:30,540 --> 01:28:31,540
We can light this up.

1423
01:28:33,640 --> 01:28:35,040
And then we've already been here.

1424
01:28:35,140 --> 01:28:35,700
That's wonderful.

1425
01:28:36,760 --> 01:28:37,620
Let's go over here now.

1426
01:28:37,720 --> 01:28:38,540
This is way too dark.

1427
01:28:39,520 --> 01:28:40,520
Oh, where did you come from?

1428
01:28:41,480 --> 01:28:42,600
Did you spawn right here?

1429
01:28:42,660 --> 01:28:43,940
Is that dark enough for you to spawn?

1430
01:28:45,000 --> 01:28:45,660
No way.

1431
01:28:48,180 --> 01:28:48,540
Really?

1432
01:28:48,920 --> 01:28:50,380
That means this is dark enough too.

1433
01:28:53,840 --> 01:28:54,780
This is way too dark.

1434
01:28:58,720 --> 01:29:04,680
Maybe we should do some kind of systematic experiment testing the radius of the light.

1435
01:29:05,620 --> 01:29:09,260
But I don't know how I would do that systematically because they just spawn randomly, right?

1436
01:29:09,980 --> 01:29:11,840
I guess I could make a platform in the ocean again.

1437
01:29:12,260 --> 01:29:13,320
Put a light in the center.

1438
01:29:15,620 --> 01:29:21,300
And then gradually make the platform bigger in all directions and see when... Actually, yeah, that would be the perfect way to do it.

1439
01:29:21,380 --> 01:29:21,880
I just fixed it.

1440
01:29:23,360 --> 01:29:24,400
I'm going to test that next.

1441
01:29:26,060 --> 01:29:27,020
That's a beautiful test.

1442
01:29:28,020 --> 01:29:29,200
That's exactly how to do it.

1443
01:29:31,420 --> 01:29:37,620
For a brief moment there, I thought, there's no way to do this systematically, in a way that would make sense, but then immediately I came up with a systematic way.

1444
01:29:39,220 --> 01:29:40,120
Isn't life grand?

1445
01:29:42,140 --> 01:29:43,780
Oh no, look at all this darkness!

1446
01:29:44,420 --> 01:29:44,780
Fuck.

1447
01:29:47,240 --> 01:29:51,140
Problem is, I don't know how far away... horizontally, I mean, from my home I am now.

1448
01:29:53,680 --> 01:29:54,880
Maybe I should dig right up.

1449
01:29:56,320 --> 01:29:57,060
Oh god.

1450
01:29:57,540 --> 01:29:58,200
Oh no.

1451
01:29:59,380 --> 01:30:00,180
That's way too dark.

1452
01:30:06,340 --> 01:30:07,460
Let's put a light there.

1453
01:30:14,600 --> 01:30:16,060
This part here, of course.

1454
01:30:16,920 --> 01:30:18,680
Yeah, I think right here I'm gonna dig up.

1455
01:30:21,950 --> 01:30:23,750
See where we are in relation.

1456
01:30:27,130 --> 01:30:27,550
Yeah.

1457
01:30:28,950 --> 01:30:29,730
It's going to be tough.

1458
01:30:39,130 --> 01:30:40,750
We're going to do a little bit of podcasting.

1459
01:30:52,020 --> 01:30:53,500
Man, even I can't see shit.

1460
01:30:54,660 --> 01:30:56,600
And I'm sitting in a sort of dark room.

1461
01:30:56,620 --> 01:30:59,100
Actually, there's a bit of annoying light leaking through my window.

1462
01:31:00,900 --> 01:31:03,200
They told me this window would be opaque, and it isn't.

1463
01:31:03,540 --> 01:31:05,220
It's actually... it's more like a window, I guess.

1464
01:31:05,820 --> 01:31:06,840
It's letting light through.

1465
01:31:07,740 --> 01:31:08,140
Fuck.

1466
01:31:21,820 --> 01:31:22,660
Isn't it kind of funny?

1467
01:31:22,820 --> 01:31:26,360
In Minecraft, I am trying to light up everything.

1468
01:31:26,480 --> 01:31:28,300
In real life, I'm trying to remove light.

1469
01:31:30,280 --> 01:31:30,920
Oh, no!

1470
01:31:33,340 --> 01:31:34,780
Oh, wait, I've already sort of been here?

1471
01:31:34,900 --> 01:31:35,500
Okay, okay, okay.

1472
01:31:35,640 --> 01:31:36,240
Wait, where did I come from?

1473
01:31:36,580 --> 01:31:37,380
Here, I think.

1474
01:31:43,120 --> 01:31:45,000
Yeah, I gotta get back down here, I guess.

1475
01:31:45,680 --> 01:31:51,020
Even though I may be quite far horizontally, I think I'm no longer far vertically now from my village.

1476
01:31:51,500 --> 01:31:53,900
So this place definitely needs to be lit as well.

1477
01:31:58,320 --> 01:32:01,060
I'm gonna put a sign as soon as we hit the surface.

1478
01:32:02,040 --> 01:32:02,880
Signify where we are.

1479
01:32:10,100 --> 01:32:20,140
Dude, I'm kind of liking diorite when you're podcasting because it's naturally a little bit lighter than the other blocks.

1480
01:32:20,860 --> 01:32:21,860
Easy to see.

1481
01:32:31,360 --> 01:32:32,240
Oh, shit.

1482
01:32:33,300 --> 01:32:34,120
We're in the water.

1483
01:32:36,620 --> 01:32:37,100
Oh!

1484
01:32:38,300 --> 01:32:39,580
We're barely in the water.

1485
01:32:42,880 --> 01:32:43,600
Down here.

1486
01:32:45,940 --> 01:32:46,880
I can't spell.

1487
01:32:48,580 --> 01:32:49,340
Where's my home?

1488
01:32:49,960 --> 01:32:51,300
Tell me I'm so far away.

1489
01:32:51,420 --> 01:32:52,560
Please tell me I'm far away from home.

1490
01:32:54,660 --> 01:32:56,280
Ah, it's not that far.

1491
01:33:00,810 --> 01:33:02,210
Yeah, that needs to be lit.

1492
01:33:02,730 --> 01:33:03,190
Confirmed.

1493
01:33:03,590 --> 01:33:04,990
Okay, so we're not that far.

1494
01:33:06,170 --> 01:33:06,810
Back down.

1495
01:33:10,550 --> 01:33:11,470
Stop the waterfall.

1496
01:33:19,210 --> 01:33:19,950
Here we are.

1497
01:33:20,730 --> 01:33:21,990
Time to light this place up.

1498
01:33:26,050 --> 01:33:43,330
I just realized, when I saw this huge density of enemies just before, it could also have been the fact that night occurred upstairs, which means... No, that it was day upstairs, and then there were no spawn points up there, and then everything sort of came down here instead.

1499
01:33:44,650 --> 01:33:48,550
I'm realizing that could have been the thing happening there, now that I think about it.

1500
01:33:50,390 --> 01:33:50,870
Yeah.

1501
01:33:51,690 --> 01:33:52,630
Let's just keep lighting.

1502
01:34:11,810 --> 01:34:12,290
Whoo!

1503
01:34:12,510 --> 01:34:13,330
Almost exploded.

1504
01:34:15,670 --> 01:34:16,910
Do I have a natural EDP?

1505
01:34:18,330 --> 01:34:18,810
Kinda?

1506
01:34:19,050 --> 01:34:19,510
Not really.

1507
01:34:20,170 --> 01:34:21,110
I'll have to make one.

1508
01:34:29,450 --> 01:34:30,810
Man, why is the spider so big?

1509
01:34:31,550 --> 01:34:32,590
It's a huge spider.

1510
01:34:37,030 --> 01:34:37,750
Good night.

1511
01:34:38,450 --> 01:34:39,550
One hit, one kill.

1512
01:34:39,690 --> 01:34:39,990
Uh-oh.

1513
01:34:42,090 --> 01:34:42,450
Nice.

1514
01:34:45,230 --> 01:34:46,370
Oh my god, there's so many enemies!

1515
01:34:46,530 --> 01:34:47,470
Okay, I need to light this.

1516
01:34:48,130 --> 01:34:49,430
Otherwise, it's a never-ending battle.

1517
01:34:50,310 --> 01:34:51,590
They keep spawning.

1518
01:34:52,190 --> 01:34:53,150
These fuckers.

1519
01:34:54,490 --> 01:34:55,490
Light the... Wait, I've been here.

1520
01:34:56,530 --> 01:34:57,250
I made that.

1521
01:34:58,330 --> 01:34:59,130
I've been in here!

1522
01:35:00,210 --> 01:35:01,170
What the fuck?

1523
01:35:01,810 --> 01:35:04,710
Did I make my way out of here, or did I come down here?

1524
01:35:06,470 --> 01:35:07,130
Nobody knows.

1525
01:35:08,110 --> 01:35:09,090
I'm actually in a bad spot.

1526
01:35:09,690 --> 01:35:10,430
A bad spot!

1527
01:35:12,310 --> 01:35:12,690
Jesus.

1528
01:35:18,750 --> 01:35:20,270
How do I... Oh, I'm using my axe.

1529
01:35:20,370 --> 01:35:21,150
I see, I see, I see.

1530
01:35:25,110 --> 01:35:26,490
Still way too dark here.

1531
01:35:29,310 --> 01:35:30,390
Light everything, then kill.

1532
01:35:34,000 --> 01:35:35,020
That's how we do it, baby.

1533
01:35:40,300 --> 01:35:40,720
Ouch.

1534
01:35:41,860 --> 01:35:43,300
Yeah, light the perimeter first.

1535
01:35:45,320 --> 01:35:46,460
The entire perimeter.

1536
01:35:47,380 --> 01:35:48,740
I've already been here, it seems.

1537
01:35:49,340 --> 01:35:52,100
Oh, this is a... Oh, dude, dude, dude, dude, dude, I need this.

1538
01:35:54,440 --> 01:35:55,480
I need that.

1539
01:35:57,660 --> 01:35:58,820
I need it badly.

1540
01:36:02,920 --> 01:36:04,620
Oh, wait, let me do it from here.

1541
01:36:06,800 --> 01:36:08,040
Oh, yeah, right, they're still spawning.

1542
01:36:09,100 --> 01:36:10,940
I mean, I'm getting experience killing them.

1543
01:36:11,000 --> 01:36:11,700
It's not the worst.

1544
01:36:12,900 --> 01:36:15,520
Let's just make a little perimeter around that place first.

1545
01:36:15,660 --> 01:36:16,860
Look how many enemies are here!

1546
01:36:17,040 --> 01:36:18,960
This is a huge issue, this area.

1547
01:36:20,140 --> 01:36:23,460
It's gonna be feeling so good fixing this... Look how many enemies!

1548
01:36:23,900 --> 01:36:24,700
Holy fuck!

1549
01:36:31,890 --> 01:36:33,270
I am in trouble.

1550
01:36:36,990 --> 01:36:38,630
Oh my god, you're throwing crap at me?

1551
01:36:41,390 --> 01:36:42,330
How are you not dead?

1552
01:36:44,970 --> 01:36:45,770
Oh my goodness.

1553
01:36:52,170 --> 01:36:52,850
I'm burning.

1554
01:36:53,550 --> 01:36:54,530
I am so dead.

1555
01:36:55,910 --> 01:36:57,010
Why, there's so many enemies!

1556
01:37:00,500 --> 01:37:01,160
Please die.

1557
01:37:03,020 --> 01:37:03,620
Thank you.

1558
01:37:07,880 --> 01:37:08,720
I have no horses.

1559
01:37:08,940 --> 01:37:09,840
I need to grab my thing again.

1560
01:37:13,580 --> 01:37:14,240
There we go.

1561
01:37:16,640 --> 01:37:17,360
Did I get it?

1562
01:37:18,780 --> 01:37:19,440
I got it.

1563
01:37:23,770 --> 01:37:25,410
Okay, we're holding the fort here.

1564
01:37:26,690 --> 01:37:27,430
Not bad.

1565
01:37:28,830 --> 01:37:29,870
This guy fell down.

1566
01:37:32,630 --> 01:37:33,730
Yeah, we gotta kill everything.

1567
01:37:38,970 --> 01:37:40,850
Oh my GOD, dude!

1568
01:37:43,370 --> 01:37:45,070
Alright, I'm lighting this whole place first.

1569
01:37:49,520 --> 01:37:50,420
Oh, wow.

1570
01:37:51,160 --> 01:37:51,600
Wow.

1571
01:37:52,280 --> 01:37:53,500
Actually, they're all hitting each other.

1572
01:37:54,100 --> 01:37:54,660
Look at that.

1573
01:37:56,840 --> 01:37:58,200
Running circles around them.

1574
01:37:58,640 --> 01:37:59,760
Making them hit each other.

1575
01:38:00,680 --> 01:38:01,660
Something exploded.

1576
01:38:01,880 --> 01:38:03,360
My goodness, they're having a war.

1577
01:38:04,120 --> 01:38:05,260
And I enjoy that.

1578
01:38:05,600 --> 01:38:06,040
Man.

1579
01:38:06,900 --> 01:38:08,640
They want a piece of me, all of them.

1580
01:38:18,920 --> 01:38:20,700
I'm actually getting good at dodging arrows.

1581
01:38:28,320 --> 01:38:29,860
There's a lot of skeletons.

1582
01:38:42,480 --> 01:38:43,340
Don't mind me.

1583
01:38:44,740 --> 01:38:46,700
Oh, this leads down to somewhere I've already been.

1584
01:38:46,800 --> 01:38:47,660
That's fantastic.

1585
01:38:53,360 --> 01:38:53,840
Cool.

1586
01:38:54,120 --> 01:38:54,480
All right.

1587
01:38:55,900 --> 01:38:57,400
That actually feels good.

1588
01:39:05,320 --> 01:39:06,040
Oh, shit.

1589
01:39:07,380 --> 01:39:08,060
Come to me.

1590
01:39:17,810 --> 01:39:19,550
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, I know you're angry.

1591
01:39:20,550 --> 01:39:21,390
But so am I.

1592
01:39:24,770 --> 01:39:26,570
Man, it's not easy work here, huh?

1593
01:39:27,010 --> 01:39:28,290
Cleaning up these caves.

1594
01:39:29,370 --> 01:39:30,130
Christ almighty.

1595
01:39:33,850 --> 01:39:35,770
I wonder if Christ actually was almighty.

1596
01:39:36,370 --> 01:39:37,510
Or if he even was.

1597
01:39:38,430 --> 01:39:39,170
Like anything.

1598
01:39:39,830 --> 01:39:40,430
Probably not.

1599
01:39:41,670 --> 01:39:42,550
You'll never know.

1600
01:39:44,110 --> 01:39:45,930
It's a mystery for the ages, isn't it?

1601
01:39:52,120 --> 01:39:53,780
Maybe Christ was all-knowing.

1602
01:39:56,540 --> 01:40:00,500
Like a certain other gentleman whose name I shall not utter.

1603
01:40:01,880 --> 01:40:03,400
Someone I hate, by the way.

1604
01:40:05,580 --> 01:40:06,360
Do that.

1605
01:40:06,520 --> 01:40:07,160
Put that there.

1606
01:40:12,160 --> 01:40:13,700
Okay, looking good, looking good.

1607
01:40:13,800 --> 01:40:17,400
There's still dark spots everywhere, but... It's a good start.

1608
01:40:17,760 --> 01:40:20,360
Now I have to remember where the fuck the, uh... Oops.

1609
01:40:22,160 --> 01:40:23,360
The deposit was.

1610
01:40:23,940 --> 01:40:25,420
It should be somewhere over there, I guess.

1611
01:40:25,820 --> 01:40:26,480
I'll find it.

1612
01:40:29,780 --> 01:40:31,300
Just keep lighting up the place.

1613
01:40:32,260 --> 01:40:34,560
Maybe I'm overdoing it a little bit here with the torches.

1614
01:40:41,590 --> 01:40:42,770
Fuck, fuck.

1615
01:40:43,710 --> 01:40:45,250
Look at all that experience.

1616
01:40:46,770 --> 01:40:48,090
Level 25?

1617
01:40:48,430 --> 01:40:48,630
Damn.

1618
01:40:55,150 --> 01:40:55,990
Okay.

1619
01:40:58,170 --> 01:40:59,250
Whoopsie-daisy.

1620
01:40:59,670 --> 01:41:00,230
Nah, come here.

1621
01:41:05,610 --> 01:41:06,450
Dah!

1622
01:41:23,220 --> 01:41:23,700
Nice!

