1886
02:05:39,840 --> 02:05:41,040
I'll get there just in case.

1887
02:05:42,460 --> 02:05:43,480
Actually, I see a bunch of dark.

1888
02:05:48,720 --> 02:05:50,040
Oh yeah, this was totally worth it.

1889
02:05:51,620 --> 02:05:52,460
Light that up.

1890
02:05:54,700 --> 02:05:58,220
That pillar there is kind of messing with me a little bit.

1891
02:06:03,740 --> 02:06:04,280
Saved it.

1892
02:06:05,200 --> 02:06:07,580
That could have been a big mistake.

1893
02:06:13,740 --> 02:06:15,900
I can't live with this pillar being unlit.

1894
02:06:18,140 --> 02:06:20,520
And I need to have the light right on top of it.

1895
02:06:21,060 --> 02:06:22,340
Otherwise it's not satisfying.

1896
02:06:23,320 --> 02:06:24,360
Wait, do I even have...

1897
02:06:35,440 --> 02:06:36,400
I got no more torches.

1898
02:06:37,600 --> 02:06:38,900
Guess that means the pillar's gone.

1899
02:06:43,780 --> 02:06:44,940
And I gotta go back up.

1900
02:06:56,280 --> 02:06:57,360
Oh, I love this song.

1901
02:06:58,860 --> 02:07:00,160
Let's find a good spot to go up.

1902
02:07:01,780 --> 02:07:02,760
By the way!

1903
02:07:03,960 --> 02:07:05,700
Holy shit, I just realized.

1904
02:07:06,620 --> 02:07:09,940
The way... Oh, I know how to keep track of where I am.

1905
02:07:12,520 --> 02:07:12,920
MAPS!

1906
02:07:13,800 --> 02:07:15,660
I wonder how that works when I'm underground.

1907
02:07:16,200 --> 02:07:18,400
But I should be seeing my relative position.

1908
02:07:19,260 --> 02:07:21,140
Holy fuck, that's how I'm gonna keep track of it.

1909
02:07:22,000 --> 02:07:23,640
How did I just now think of that?

1910
02:07:24,090 --> 02:07:24,890
It's the music!

1911
02:07:25,190 --> 02:07:26,690
The music is inspiring me.

1912
02:07:27,050 --> 02:07:27,830
It's happening.

1913
02:07:28,490 --> 02:07:30,350
Wait, oh man, I'm so far down though.

1914
02:07:30,650 --> 02:07:31,550
But I'm not!

1915
02:07:31,770 --> 02:07:32,550
Because I can fly!

1916
02:07:36,090 --> 02:07:36,450
Easy!

1917
02:07:37,790 --> 02:07:38,810
Take me out of here!

1918
02:07:39,210 --> 02:07:39,850
Up in the corner!

1919
02:07:40,990 --> 02:07:41,550
Oh god.

1920
02:07:44,690 --> 02:07:46,730
Okay, we're gonna be podcasting a little bit here.

1921
02:07:50,170 --> 02:07:51,570
Oh wait, I do actually have a couple.

1922
02:07:52,670 --> 02:07:53,490
Let's put one here.

1923
02:07:54,150 --> 02:07:54,690
And here.

1924
02:07:54,850 --> 02:07:55,570
That's the last one.

1925
02:07:55,650 --> 02:07:56,210
The last torch!

1926
02:07:56,790 --> 02:07:57,670
Let me just double check.

1927
02:07:57,710 --> 02:07:58,410
Is it the last torch?

1928
02:07:58,590 --> 02:07:59,270
It is the last torch.

1929
02:08:00,630 --> 02:08:01,310
Alright, let's go.

1930
02:08:03,180 --> 02:08:04,300
Is that alright?

1931
02:08:09,100 --> 02:08:10,220
Okay, guys.

1932
02:08:10,900 --> 02:08:11,580
Day or night?

1933
02:08:12,300 --> 02:08:13,440
Day or night?

1934
02:08:15,200 --> 02:08:17,280
I say... night.

1935
02:08:18,260 --> 02:08:19,720
I feel the night.

1936
02:08:24,320 --> 02:08:25,780
The moon is out.

1937
02:08:26,060 --> 02:08:27,160
Wolves are howling.

1938
02:08:28,580 --> 02:08:29,060
Fuck!

1939
02:08:30,660 --> 02:08:31,860
Well, shit.

1940
02:08:35,140 --> 02:08:39,060
I mean, it's night somewhere on the globe, right?

1941
02:08:41,540 --> 02:08:43,500
So wait, I need to sort of mark this.

1942
02:08:45,200 --> 02:08:46,880
Let's do a little something here.

1943
02:08:48,520 --> 02:08:49,260
Where am I?

1944
02:08:57,000 --> 02:08:58,120
Ah, look at that!

1945
02:08:58,380 --> 02:08:59,520
Testing platform over there.

1946
02:08:59,840 --> 02:09:00,640
It's right over here.

1947
02:09:00,860 --> 02:09:02,400
So it's right on the coast.

1948
02:09:05,410 --> 02:09:06,330
Let's do that instead.

1949
02:09:06,570 --> 02:09:07,230
That's easy to remember.

1950
02:09:10,810 --> 02:09:13,050
I would say, though, still quite far from home.

1951
02:09:16,640 --> 02:09:18,320
And again, how many blocks is that?

1952
02:09:18,740 --> 02:09:22,480
And if you also go down, you have to do the Pythagorean in that case.

1953
02:09:23,120 --> 02:09:28,460
Oh, but the problem is... Oh, I need to test for rectangle or sphere.

1954
02:09:29,560 --> 02:09:30,040
Wait.

1955
02:09:30,420 --> 02:09:32,180
Okay, so we need to test light radius?

1956
02:09:32,480 --> 02:09:34,620
We need to test rectangle or square?

1957
02:09:34,940 --> 02:09:36,360
Probably square, if anything.

1958
02:09:37,040 --> 02:09:38,780
Or not square, cube, I guess.

1959
02:09:39,400 --> 02:09:41,020
Cube or sphere?

1960
02:09:41,640 --> 02:09:42,720
How do I test for that?

1961
02:09:42,800 --> 02:09:43,620
I guess I would...

1962
02:09:44,480 --> 02:09:47,820
I guess I would go... Wait.

1963
02:09:49,540 --> 02:09:50,460
Actually, hold on.

1964
02:09:51,420 --> 02:09:52,780
Cube doesn't make any sense.

1965
02:09:52,900 --> 02:09:58,900
If you want to have a consistent 128 radius, the only way to do that is a sphere.

1966
02:09:59,560 --> 02:10:00,360
Mathematically here.

1967
02:10:00,580 --> 02:10:01,120
Geometrically.

1968
02:10:01,880 --> 02:10:09,700
Unless there is a difference in distance depending on the angle from you, but that wouldn't make any sense.

1969
02:10:11,270 --> 02:10:12,970
No, I'm gonna assume it's a sphere.

1970
02:10:13,110 --> 02:10:15,470
Otherwise, I'm gonna lose my mind.

1971
02:10:15,970 --> 02:10:16,190
Yeah.

1972
02:10:17,830 --> 02:10:19,070
I really hope it's a sphere.

1973
02:10:20,370 --> 02:10:21,350
Put the wood in here, please.

1974
02:10:21,430 --> 02:10:22,230
No, actually, keep the wood.

1975
02:10:22,330 --> 02:10:22,690
I have this wood.

1976
02:10:22,830 --> 02:10:23,030
That's fine.

1977
02:10:24,110 --> 02:10:24,690
Brewing in.

1978
02:10:24,850 --> 02:10:26,490
I need to make way more torches.

1979
02:10:27,310 --> 02:10:29,050
Problem is, I can't.

1980
02:10:30,030 --> 02:10:30,710
Wait, I can.

1981
02:10:32,050 --> 02:10:33,150
I forgot I had this.

1982
02:10:33,810 --> 02:10:35,130
Oh, yeah, I have many.

1983
02:10:35,870 --> 02:10:37,130
Oh, easy, easy, easy.

1984
02:10:37,870 --> 02:10:38,890
No problem at all.

1985
02:10:41,830 --> 02:10:42,630
Torch time.

1986
02:10:46,650 --> 02:10:47,530
Fill it up.

1987
02:10:48,570 --> 02:10:49,170
More.

1988
02:10:51,810 --> 02:10:53,050
Oh my god, look how many.

1989
02:10:54,530 --> 02:10:55,570
Now we're talking!

1990
02:10:56,150 --> 02:10:57,170
I can make more.

1991
02:10:57,850 --> 02:10:58,470
We're not done.

1992
02:11:01,090 --> 02:11:02,410
One more of those stacks.

1993
02:11:02,850 --> 02:11:03,510
That should be enough.

1994
02:11:06,230 --> 02:11:08,810
Give me... oak maybe?

1995
02:11:08,950 --> 02:11:09,570
No, some spruce.

1996
02:11:17,710 --> 02:11:19,710
Should probably fix my inventory first.

1997
02:11:24,390 --> 02:11:25,770
Let me disenchant that.

1998
02:11:27,010 --> 02:11:28,390
Also, food situation?

1999
02:11:28,890 --> 02:11:30,010
Uh, feeding situation!

2000
02:11:30,730 --> 02:11:32,290
What the fuck?!

2001
02:11:37,890 --> 02:11:38,490
Donovan!

2002
02:11:38,490 --> 02:11:39,090
Jackster!

2003
02:11:39,310 --> 02:11:39,910
What the?

2004
02:11:40,030 --> 02:11:40,810
How did you get in?

2005
02:11:42,310 --> 02:11:44,370
What are you guys doing here?

2006
02:11:46,430 --> 02:11:47,030
Hello?

2007
02:11:50,330 --> 02:11:50,930
Uh...

2008
02:11:53,540 --> 02:11:56,140
How the hell am I going to let them out without letting the cows out?

2009
02:11:56,560 --> 02:11:56,820
Go!

2010
02:11:58,780 --> 02:11:59,180
No!

2011
02:12:00,700 --> 02:12:01,100
Go!

2012
02:12:02,720 --> 02:12:03,120
No!

2013
02:12:04,880 --> 02:12:05,480
Move on!

2014
02:12:05,880 --> 02:12:07,580
You need to be 18 to get out.

2015
02:12:09,880 --> 02:12:10,280
Go!

2016
02:12:11,100 --> 02:12:11,480
Yeah!

2017
02:12:12,120 --> 02:12:12,520
Lovely!

2018
02:12:12,640 --> 02:12:13,140
There we go.

2019
02:12:13,440 --> 02:12:13,920
Alright then.

2020
02:12:16,740 --> 02:12:17,340
Feed you.

2021
02:12:17,480 --> 02:12:17,840
Feed you.

2022
02:12:17,940 --> 02:12:18,620
You're going to have sex.

2023
02:12:19,160 --> 02:12:20,300
You're going to have sex too.

2024
02:12:20,380 --> 02:12:21,160
We're going to have two children.

2025
02:12:22,110 --> 02:12:22,510
Boom!

2026
02:12:22,790 --> 02:12:23,150
Look at that.

2027
02:12:24,690 --> 02:12:25,470
Easy peasy.

2028
02:12:26,010 --> 02:12:27,410
I will kill some of you now.

2029
02:12:27,570 --> 02:12:27,890
Two of you.

2030
02:12:33,330 --> 02:12:35,210
I need to kill you with this, though.

2031
02:12:38,530 --> 02:12:39,210
They're burning!

2032
02:12:42,750 --> 02:12:43,390
I'm sorry!

2033
02:12:43,850 --> 02:12:45,310
Okay, you survive, you survive.

2034
02:12:45,770 --> 02:12:46,210
That's good.

2035
02:12:46,810 --> 02:12:47,750
I need to get in here.

2036
02:12:49,090 --> 02:12:50,050
Wait, are they fa-

2037
02:12:53,150 --> 02:12:53,990
Wait a minute.

2038
02:12:56,210 --> 02:12:57,670
Oh my god!

2039
02:13:00,430 --> 02:13:02,710
They're following me because I have the wheat!

2040
02:13:03,910 --> 02:13:04,550
Look!

2041
02:13:07,050 --> 02:13:08,530
Dude, that's huge!

2042
02:13:10,030 --> 02:13:11,430
Look, now I don't have it.

2043
02:13:12,730 --> 02:13:14,570
Now they couldn't care less.

2044
02:13:15,470 --> 02:13:15,910
Now though?

2045
02:13:16,150 --> 02:13:17,190
Hey, yo!

2046
02:13:17,590 --> 02:13:20,910
This is probably way better than the... Dude.

2047
02:13:21,710 --> 02:13:22,630
Come here.

2048
02:13:24,670 --> 02:13:27,010
That is a huge discovery!

2049
02:13:27,310 --> 02:13:27,870
Wow!

2050
02:13:29,030 --> 02:13:30,150
Wait.

2051
02:13:33,250 --> 02:13:34,390
Does that work on everything?

2052
02:13:35,290 --> 02:13:36,150
Maybe even villagers.

2053
02:13:36,390 --> 02:13:38,270
Can I lure villagers with taters?

2054
02:13:40,990 --> 02:13:43,350
I mean, I know I would be able to lure myself, you know?

2055
02:13:43,430 --> 02:13:44,610
I try to put myself in their position.

2056
02:13:45,010 --> 02:13:45,610
Okay, so it's night.

2057
02:13:46,750 --> 02:13:48,190
Let's go do testing while it's night.

2058
02:13:49,790 --> 02:13:51,750
Quickly fix a little bit of the inventory, then we test.

2059
02:13:55,790 --> 02:13:56,510
Let's see here.

2060
02:13:56,750 --> 02:13:57,590
Food, food, food, food, food.

2061
02:13:58,490 --> 02:13:59,650
I need a bit more food.

2062
02:13:59,710 --> 02:14:00,790
I don't even know what dough.

2063
02:14:02,860 --> 02:14:03,540
Where's my stakes?

2064
02:14:03,740 --> 02:14:05,020
Did I only get three stakes from that?

2065
02:14:05,160 --> 02:14:06,280
That's unfortunate.

2066
02:14:09,560 --> 02:14:10,300
Fill that up.

2067
02:14:10,500 --> 02:14:11,560
I have way too many planks.

2068
02:14:14,160 --> 02:14:15,620
Let's disenchant that real quick.

2069
02:14:18,900 --> 02:14:20,260
This one is bullshit.

2070
02:14:22,260 --> 02:14:23,120
There, there.

2071
02:14:23,620 --> 02:14:24,720
A clay ball?

2072
02:14:25,280 --> 02:14:27,040
Wait, this one also needs to be disenchanted.

2073
02:14:29,900 --> 02:14:31,180
Quick deletion.

2074
02:14:36,300 --> 02:14:37,080
Good.

2075
02:14:44,200 --> 02:14:44,980
Coal?

2076
02:14:46,280 --> 02:14:47,720
Keep it on me, actually.

2077
02:14:59,970 --> 02:15:00,790
In you go.

2078
02:15:02,470 --> 02:15:03,970
Getting so much gunpowder.

2079
02:15:07,190 --> 02:15:08,030
A clay ball?

2080
02:15:08,150 --> 02:15:08,810
I would say up here.

2081
02:15:09,010 --> 02:15:10,350
Because I don't really know where to put it.

2082
02:15:11,150 --> 02:15:11,390
Alright.

2083
02:15:14,750 --> 02:15:15,870
Now I need a lot of dirt.

2084
02:15:17,350 --> 02:15:19,230
Well, not... I don't have that much, I guess.

2085
02:15:19,370 --> 02:15:21,130
But something to destroy easily.

2086
02:15:22,850 --> 02:15:25,250
I guess that is fast to destroy with my pickaxe.

2087
02:15:29,790 --> 02:15:31,150
Let's do a quick test over here.

2088
02:15:32,590 --> 02:15:37,410
Actually, I'm gonna need... I would like to have dirt.

2089
02:15:37,630 --> 02:15:38,590
It's way easier to destroy.

2090
02:15:39,850 --> 02:15:40,910
Problem is, I won't have time.

2091
02:15:42,250 --> 02:15:42,890
Ah, fuck it.

2092
02:15:49,650 --> 02:15:51,990
Let's see, if I put a torch there...

2093
02:15:59,790 --> 02:16:00,590
Oh, you know what?

2094
02:16:17,670 --> 02:16:18,710
We're gonna do this instead.

2095
02:16:29,790 --> 02:16:31,610
I'm gonna assume nothing can spawn in here.

2096
02:16:31,690 --> 02:16:33,750
I feel like this is too bright for anything to spawn.

2097
02:16:39,610 --> 02:16:43,350
So now we need to get to between... like 25-ish.

2098
02:16:43,850 --> 02:16:44,510
Fuck, I didn't count.

2099
02:16:45,010 --> 02:16:45,530
Doesn't matter.

2100
02:16:45,610 --> 02:16:46,470
They're gonna spawn at some point.

2101
02:16:49,730 --> 02:16:50,130
Hopefully.

2102
02:16:53,770 --> 02:16:54,450
Oh, no.

2103
02:16:56,390 --> 02:16:57,490
The worst time.

2104
02:17:06,230 --> 02:17:07,130
Nothing has spawned yet.

2105
02:17:07,490 --> 02:17:10,310
The further up I go, the bigger the chance of anything spawning, by the way.

2106
02:17:10,410 --> 02:17:11,350
It's gonna be fast soon.

2107
02:17:12,230 --> 02:17:13,170
Maybe they'll use dirt now.

2108
02:17:19,910 --> 02:17:21,530
Actually, you can see that the light goes to here.

2109
02:17:21,650 --> 02:17:21,990
You see that?

2110
02:17:23,450 --> 02:17:24,350
That's like the edge.

2111
02:17:26,550 --> 02:17:31,910
Can't really see it when you zoom, but when you look at it like that... Wait, really?

2112
02:17:32,010 --> 02:17:32,770
Nothing spawns on there?

2113
02:17:38,670 --> 02:17:40,170
There's got to be something spawning there, though.

2114
02:17:52,510 --> 02:17:57,490
I am definitely... Maybe... Wow, there's no way.

2115
02:17:58,830 --> 02:17:59,590
Let's wait a bit.

2116
02:18:21,210 --> 02:18:23,270
Thank God only one of them spawns here at a time.

2117
02:18:26,750 --> 02:18:27,890
I should have made it longer.

2118
02:18:28,550 --> 02:18:29,730
Why didn't I make that platform longer?

2119
02:18:31,330 --> 02:18:31,950
Damn it.

2120
02:18:42,190 --> 02:18:42,590
Really?

2121
02:18:49,170 --> 02:18:58,710
I mean, it could also simply be a lower possibility or chance of anything spawning there, because it is a... well, an SLJ, right?

2122
02:19:04,090 --> 02:19:08,510
Come on, the interns are frothing at the mouth right now, wanting to spawn things.

2123
02:19:09,950 --> 02:19:10,950
Come on, look at that!

2124
02:19:11,110 --> 02:19:11,690
See it, please!

2125
02:19:17,100 --> 02:19:18,140
Alright, fine.

2126
02:19:43,040 --> 02:19:44,040
Oh, hey there!

2127
02:19:44,860 --> 02:19:45,660
What's up?

2128
02:19:50,640 --> 02:19:52,820
Wait a minute, they are spawning these in the water.

2129
02:19:53,020 --> 02:19:55,480
That's kind of not what I want to happen.

2130
02:20:11,760 --> 02:20:12,200
Sick!

2131
02:20:14,720 --> 02:20:15,380
Pro shit.

2132
02:20:32,460 --> 02:20:35,080
I feel like the audio is bugging out a little bit when I'm this high up.

2133
02:20:36,720 --> 02:20:38,000
Oh no, it's day!

2134
02:20:39,300 --> 02:20:40,640
Oh no!

2135
02:20:42,700 --> 02:20:43,400
Fuck you.

2136
02:20:48,260 --> 02:20:49,580
Alright, I guess I'll be back later.

2137
02:20:52,000 --> 02:20:53,220
Rome wasn't built in one day.

2138
02:21:01,360 --> 02:21:03,960
Oh, dude, you know what I can also test on that platform?

2139
02:21:04,840 --> 02:21:06,100
The spider situation.

2140
02:21:06,880 --> 02:21:09,660
We can try various anti-spider measures.

2141
02:21:11,860 --> 02:21:13,800
We just removed the torch, of course, in that case.

2142
02:21:15,600 --> 02:21:16,640
Here you go, buddies.

2143
02:21:17,460 --> 02:21:18,840
Keep eating that food.

2144
02:21:19,220 --> 02:21:20,400
Keep making babies.

2145
02:21:25,710 --> 02:21:26,470
What's up, Erika?

2146
02:21:27,230 --> 02:21:28,170
You want some meat?

2147
02:21:29,530 --> 02:21:30,570
You don't want that, huh?

2148
02:21:32,410 --> 02:21:35,010
Do you like some salmon?

2149
02:21:36,570 --> 02:21:37,930
Yeah, you do like salmon.

2150
02:21:38,290 --> 02:21:39,010
There you go.

2151
02:21:39,370 --> 02:21:39,830
Enjoy it.

2152
02:21:42,010 --> 02:21:43,130
Where did I put my meat?

2153
02:21:44,370 --> 02:21:45,210
Oh, here it is.

2154
02:21:46,170 --> 02:21:46,370
Okay.

2155
02:21:47,050 --> 02:21:47,490
Dirt.

2156
02:21:48,390 --> 02:21:48,830
Stone.

2157
02:21:49,870 --> 02:21:51,630
We are ready to keep going.

2158
02:21:52,530 --> 02:21:53,670
Torches I have a lot of.

2159
02:21:53,870 --> 02:21:54,810
Oh yeah, and these things.

2160
02:21:56,470 --> 02:21:58,230
What did I need to make tinted glass again?

2161
