2204
02:24:48,380 --> 02:24:55,060
94%... What the... There it is.

2205
02:24:55,720 --> 02:24:58,380
94% sure spherical.

2206
02:25:04,360 --> 02:25:04,800
Okay.

2207
02:25:04,800 --> 02:25:06,920
Diamonds, calcite, and all this.

2208
02:25:08,160 --> 02:25:08,980
In, in.

2209
02:25:09,480 --> 02:25:10,140
Oh, calcite?

2210
02:25:10,260 --> 02:25:12,680
I would say that is construction, because I don't really know what it is.

2211
02:25:15,500 --> 02:25:16,420
He's going here.

2212
02:25:17,900 --> 02:25:18,920
This one is soon full.

2213
02:25:26,900 --> 02:25:27,360
Right.

2214
02:25:29,540 --> 02:25:31,780
Okay, I think we're ready to go on an adventure.

2215
02:25:34,660 --> 02:25:35,480
Torches are there.

2216
02:25:35,800 --> 02:25:36,900
We have all these torches in here.

2217
02:25:40,760 --> 02:25:41,600
There we go.

2218
02:25:42,380 --> 02:25:44,440
Maybe quickly go check if we can feed again.

2219
