It's just going to take a bit of time.

2250
02:27:55,890 --> 02:27:56,390
Oh, by the way!

2251
02:27:57,090 --> 02:28:04,270
I want to go back to the trial chamber that I found right underneath my home, because I'm not sure I found everything there.

2252
02:28:04,790 --> 02:28:06,370
