The golden helmet, I kind of want to repair that now while I still have levels.

2254
02:28:12,710 --> 02:28:14,270
Let's make another golden helmet here.

2255
02:28:18,370 --> 02:28:21,770
This is a fantastic nether exploration helmet.

2256
02:28:25,550 --> 02:28:26,310
Only three!

2257
02:28:26,910 --> 02:28:27,950
Isn't that lovely?

2258
02:28:29,750 --> 02:28:30,290
Done.

2259
02:28:34,120 --> 02:28:34,720
In you go.

2260
02:28:37,520 --> 02:28:38,300
I'll leave these here.

2261
02:28:38,400 --> 02:28:39,360
These aren't good to have.

2262
02:28:39,580 --> 02:28:40,480
Leave one at home.

2263
02:28:42,960 --> 02:28:43,320
Fireworks.

2264
02:28:44,060 --> 02:28:44,420
Fundamentals.

2265
02:28:44,520 --> 02:28:45,360
Put these in here for now.

2266
02:28:47,680 --> 02:28:48,040
Carrots.

2267
02:28:50,520 --> 02:28:51,260
I don't even know.

2268
02:28:51,360 --> 02:28:52,060
