If I switch it out, there's a possibility of me dying, which has happened before.

2276
02:29:21,510 --> 02:29:22,230
So it's dangerous.

2277
02:29:22,750 --> 02:29:23,610
It's a dangerous affair.

2278
02:29:24,370 --> 02:29:25,870
I don't have enough food here, unfortunately.

2279
02:29:26,270 --> 02:29:29,730
I am buying a little time here, of course, because I want to feed these once more before I leave.

2280
02:29:30,230 --> 02:29:30,630
There we go.

2281
