2289
02:29:50,350 --> 02:29:51,730
Look, I have it on.

2290
02:29:52,530 --> 02:29:53,270
Check this out.

2291
02:29:53,450 --> 02:29:57,330
And then as soon as I... as soon as I drop it, they're all gonna, like, be super sad.

2292
02:30:01,930 --> 02:30:02,830
That's amazing.

2293
02:30:04,050 --> 02:30:04,850
Actually hilarious.

2294
