2331
02:32:17,160 --> 02:32:17,600
Fuck!

2332
02:32:19,440 --> 02:32:19,880
Jesus!

2333
02:32:23,450 --> 02:32:24,390
Come on!

2334
02:32:26,150 --> 02:32:27,190
Fuck you!

2335
02:32:30,210 --> 02:32:31,730
Heck, I hate these enemies!

2336
02:32:34,010 --> 02:32:34,890
Get up!

2337
02:32:41,170 --> 02:32:42,410
Can't see shit!

2338
02:32:50,030 --> 02:32:53,230
I am so close to just turning off my audio whenever I'm in combat with those.

2339
02:32:54,310 --> 02:32:58,130
Just to not get jump-scared by the audio that when he goes, you know, comes out of nowhere.

2340
02:33:01,870 --> 02:33:03,170
Oh, lots of experience here.

2341
02:33:04,030 --> 02:33:04,550
Come on.

2342
02:33:05,030 --> 02:33:05,770
He's still on me.

2343
02:33:05,850 --> 02:33:06,470
He's still on me.

2344
02:33:06,630 --> 02:33:07,870
He's going to appear any moment now.

2345
02:33:11,450 --> 02:33:11,950
Come on.

2346
02:33:12,350 --> 02:33:13,310
You can reach me here.

2347
