Bring it on.

2350
02:33:22,460 --> 02:33:23,860
Ah...

2351
02:33:30,060 --> 02:33:31,220
Fuck, I forgot the maps!

2352
02:33:32,080 --> 02:33:32,440
Goddammit.

2353
02:33:33,640 --> 02:33:34,960
That's the thing I wanted to do.

2354
02:33:35,060 --> 02:33:35,800
Completely forgot about that.

2355
02:33:37,400 --> 02:33:38,880
That was the last thought I had in here.

2356
02:33:39,440 --> 02:33:41,920
Because I remember thinking, wait, how far away from home am I?

2357
02:33:42,000 --> 02:33:47,200
And then I had the map thought, and now I'm in the exact same spot, and I thought again, wait, how far away from home am I?

2358
02:33:47,340 --> 02:33:49,160
And then I immediately thought about the maps again.

2359
02:33:50,340 --> 02:33:50,700
Shit.

2360
02:33:51,820 --> 02:33:53,700
I mean, we're still kind of close to home.

2361
02:33:54,620 --> 02:33:54,940
Shit.

2362
02:33:55,740 --> 02:33:57,660
Actually, I know I'm southeast of home.

2363
02:33:59,860 --> 02:34:13,380
So if I can figure out where Northwest is... Wait, I know circa where I am, so if... Just blow up, I don't care.

2364
02:34:16,910 --> 02:34:30,370
So if that is pointing towards the... well, the place where I initially spawn in the world... then I do believe home is like that way... ish.

2365
02:34:33,370 --> 02:34:37,170
So maybe I fix this cave and don't go in this direction anymore.

2366
02:34:39,310 --> 02:34:40,390
That seems about right.

2367
02:34:42,250 --> 02:34:43,890
I should be out of range then.

2368
02:34:47,460 --> 02:34:48,480
Why don't I just fly?

2369
02:34:50,080 --> 02:34:51,480
Because I don't have the armor on!

2370
02:34:51,640 --> 02:34:52,820
This is why I always have it on!

2371
02:34:53,080 --> 02:34:54,500
I will never change it out again.

2372
02:34:54,680 --> 02:34:55,140
Ever again.

2373
02:34:55,280 --> 02:34:56,240
I will always have a light track.

2374
02:34:56,380 --> 02:34:57,860
Never will I ever switch back.

2375
02:34:59,560 --> 02:35:00,780
Holy crap, man.

2376
02:35:03,280 --> 02:35:05,320
I called this, like, five minutes ago, too.

2377
02:35:06,940 --> 02:35:07,940
Why did I switch it?

2378
02:35:10,840 --> 02:35:12,340
I'm just glad I didn't die just now.

2379
02:35:14,410 --> 02:35:19,550
I'm actually angry with myself for not sticking to my principle of not switching it.

2380
02:35:27,360 --> 02:35:28,580
Okay, this is looking good, though.

2381
02:35:29,560 --> 02:35:30,740
The lighting is insane.

2382
02:35:32,220 --> 02:35:33,760
You've never seen lighting like this.

2383
02:35:36,580 --> 02:35:45,220
Every time I sort of use the Elytra to dive down into the ground like that, it feels like, yeah, well, I'm dolphin diving, you know?

2384
02:35:47,220 --> 02:35:50,700
You know when people put their hands together in front of their face and then they dive into the water?

2385
02:35:50,760 --> 02:35:52,620
That is what it feels like, but straight into the grass.

2386
02:35:52,800 --> 02:35:54,080
It seems so silly.

2387
02:35:55,940 --> 02:35:57,100
I see darkness there.

2388
02:36:01,400 --> 02:36:03,500
I haven't had a sip in about 14 minutes.

2389
02:36:10,280 --> 02:36:12,280
Yeah, parkour master, kinda.

2390
02:36:14,580 --> 02:36:16,520
Ah, that's really bad up there.

2391
02:36:20,360 --> 02:36:21,480
That could have been death!

2392
02:36:32,180 --> 02:36:35,740
The reaction times of a professional gamer.

2393
02:36:42,700 --> 02:36:46,740
Can I... I can't just, like, crouch dodge, right?

2394
02:36:47,640 --> 02:36:48,260
No.

2395
02:36:49,600 --> 02:36:50,420
Oh.

2396
02:36:52,720 --> 02:36:53,540
What?

2397
02:36:54,440 --> 02:36:55,460
There we go.

2398
02:36:57,820 --> 02:36:59,220
Let's fix this up.

2399
02:36:59,920 --> 02:37:00,940
There we go.

2400
02:37:10,720 --> 02:37:11,420
That one.

2401
02:37:13,440 --> 02:37:20,940
Yeah, so when I have lit this cave, I think it's time for me to go back to the village and then down the original shaft where I was counting blocks.

2402
02:37:21,420 --> 02:37:24,540
And then I'm going to keep going down until 128.

2403
02:37:25,820 --> 02:37:28,080
And on the way down, keep listening for sounds.

2404
02:37:29,140 --> 02:37:32,560
Then I have a baseline for where I should not dig anymore, at least.

2405
02:37:33,360 --> 02:37:33,920
You know?

2406
02:37:43,220 --> 02:37:44,640
Okay, do that one.

2407
02:37:49,760 --> 02:37:51,000
And one here too.

2408
02:37:51,740 --> 02:37:54,560
Oh, this is... this just goes deeper and deeper.

2409
02:38:01,280 --> 02:38:05,700
If I didn't have Elytra there, I would have been not dead, but maybe dead.

2410
02:38:07,900 --> 02:38:09,080
See, I'm hearing someone.

2411
02:38:10,620 --> 02:38:11,580
This is bad.

2412
02:38:13,700 --> 02:38:14,700
Where are you?

2413
02:38:17,740 --> 02:38:18,400
Oh, what the?

2414
02:38:20,020 --> 02:38:20,940
There's water in there.

2415
02:38:23,320 --> 02:38:24,840
Then I don't know where you are then, sir.

2416
02:38:26,720 --> 02:38:27,200
What the?

2417
02:38:28,740 --> 02:38:29,680
Wait, are you a zombie?

2418
02:38:29,820 --> 02:38:30,880
Are you a water zombie?

2419
02:38:36,460 --> 02:38:37,860
No, you are totally below me.

2420
02:38:42,320 --> 02:38:43,600
Ah, let me get up here, please.

2421
02:38:49,640 --> 02:38:51,240
See, I would say that's a little bit too dark.

2422
02:38:51,460 --> 02:38:52,560
Same as this right here.

2423
02:38:57,210 --> 02:39:04,810
Let's be honest, even if I do figure out the radius of the light, am I really gonna change my ways in the way I place torches in here?

2424
02:39:04,890 --> 02:39:05,470
I don't think so.

2425
02:39:05,590 --> 02:39:09,270
Like, I don't mind using a bit of extra torches just to be safe.

2426
02:39:11,210 --> 02:39:11,830
Oh, I see.

2427
02:39:12,010 --> 02:39:13,030
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

2428
02:39:13,870 --> 02:39:16,110
I saw you spawn up there and then jump down.

2429
02:39:16,590 --> 02:39:19,910
So there's a little area with no light.

2430
02:39:29,900 --> 02:39:31,780
So there's definitely mobs below me.

2431
02:39:36,260 --> 02:39:38,460
Oh, yeah, we... Wow!

2432
02:39:40,700 --> 02:39:42,180
From the fucking sky!

2433
02:39:44,260 --> 02:39:44,740
Wow!

2434
02:39:45,500 --> 02:39:46,860
No, I'm not gonna use these, actually.

2435
02:39:47,100 --> 02:39:47,560
Change my mind.

2436
02:39:50,940 --> 02:39:51,600
Please die.

2437
02:39:56,180 --> 02:39:57,540
It's a fucking minefield!

2438
02:40:00,960 --> 02:40:03,540
Thank god I have the reactions necessary here, huh?

2439
02:40:05,000 --> 02:40:06,280
This would have been the end of me.

2440
02:40:13,440 --> 02:40:13,920
Okay.

2441
02:40:15,440 --> 02:40:15,920
Whew!

2442
02:40:16,800 --> 02:40:18,660
They're spawning up there for sure.

2443
02:40:27,520 --> 02:40:28,320
Wow.

2444
02:40:28,320 --> 02:40:34,980
Tell me that wasn't... And now you arrive!

2445
02:40:36,280 --> 02:40:38,040
Took you like five minutes?

2446
02:40:39,240 --> 02:40:40,660
What the hell?

2447
02:40:41,820 --> 02:40:43,300
That's some bullshit.

2448
02:40:44,320 --> 02:40:46,060
I actually forgot about him.

2449
02:40:49,400 --> 02:40:50,280
Holy crap.

2450
02:40:52,300 --> 02:40:56,120
This is why this game is, like, so fucking scary.

2451
02:41:00,380 --> 02:41:01,800
Despite having played it so much.

2452
02:41:03,020 --> 02:41:04,260
I see stuff up there.

2453
02:41:11,020 --> 02:41:11,360
Diorite.

2454
02:41:11,360 --> 02:41:18,440
I'm gonna make a little ascension here with the remaining blocks that I don't have a lot of just to get rid of them.

2455
02:41:19,140 --> 02:41:20,000
Oh wait, I have one more.

2456
02:41:21,320 --> 02:41:21,660
Cobblestone.

2457
02:41:29,190 --> 02:41:31,270
Do I see anything else?

2458
02:41:33,090 --> 02:41:36,090
Maybe that spot over there could use a little love.

2459
02:41:37,110 --> 02:41:37,890
There we go.

2460
02:41:38,290 --> 02:41:38,630
Good enough.

2461
02:41:39,650 --> 02:41:40,070
And there.

2462
02:41:41,090 --> 02:41:43,970
Okay, I think this cave is done.

2463
02:41:46,510 --> 02:41:48,050
There's a little bit down here.

2464
02:41:49,450 --> 02:41:51,150
Let me just quickly do that too.

2465
02:41:52,870 --> 02:41:53,870
I'm not addicted.

2466
02:41:54,210 --> 02:41:56,610
I can stop whenever I want.

2467
02:41:57,800 --> 02:42:05,160
Oh, actually... The bow is way more effective against creepers than the sword.

2468
02:42:07,280 --> 02:42:08,460
The fuck is that?

2469
02:42:09,520 --> 02:42:10,620
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

2470
02:42:16,140 --> 02:42:16,700
Goddammit!

2471
02:42:17,180 --> 02:42:17,540
Ah!

2472
02:42:18,100 --> 02:42:18,660
Annoying.

2473
02:42:22,450 --> 02:42:23,570
Now, where did you spawn?

2474
02:42:24,370 --> 02:42:26,910
In fact, you could have spawned a multitude of places.

2475
02:42:27,430 --> 02:42:28,850
Could have spawned all the way over here.

2476
02:42:32,670 --> 02:42:33,470
Look at this.

2477
02:42:36,590 --> 02:42:37,710
Block of raw iron.

2478
02:42:39,510 --> 02:42:40,330
That's crazy.

2479
02:42:41,890 --> 02:42:42,550
Why not?

2480
02:42:45,370 --> 02:42:46,230
I'll take that.

2481
02:42:47,370 --> 02:42:47,870
More!

2482
02:42:50,450 --> 02:42:51,930
Holy cannoli!

2483
02:42:52,610 --> 02:42:54,090
Yo, why is there so much iron here?

2484
02:42:56,890 --> 02:42:57,810
What the fuck?

2485
02:43:02,130 --> 02:43:03,070
Maybe I'll take it.

2486
02:43:10,870 --> 02:43:11,330
Hello.

2487
02:43:11,330 --> 02:43:14,090
No, I need to light first, otherwise these guys keep coming.

2488
02:43:22,610 --> 02:43:23,610
I hate this fire.

2489
02:43:30,830 --> 02:43:33,210
I've never seen this much iron in one spot before.

2490
02:43:37,000 --> 02:43:38,300
Also, what is happening here?

2491
02:43:38,380 --> 02:43:39,240
Why does it look like this?

2492
02:43:40,660 --> 02:43:41,760
Oh, it's the clay thing.

2493
02:43:48,960 --> 02:43:49,260
Axolotl!

2494
02:43:49,660 --> 02:43:51,040
I can take one of those with me.

2495
02:43:51,920 --> 02:43:52,720
But I don't want to.

2496
02:43:53,580 --> 02:43:54,480
Yes, I do, actually.

2497
02:43:55,620 --> 02:43:56,380
I do want to.

2498
02:44:02,040 --> 02:44:03,400
Throw all kinds of crap in there.

2499
02:44:05,960 --> 02:44:10,220
I could just turn these into a... Ah, but then I need this, right?

2500
02:44:15,700 --> 02:44:16,740
Eh, do that.

2501
02:44:22,940 --> 02:44:24,540
Then I need to throw away a bunch of crap.

2502
02:44:30,220 --> 02:44:31,100
Flowering Azalea.

2503
02:44:31,340 --> 02:44:32,400
Or Azalea.

2504
02:44:33,040 --> 02:44:34,640
I will take that with me.

2505
02:44:35,180 --> 02:44:36,280
Same as moss blocks.

2506
02:44:36,520 --> 02:44:37,040
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

2507
02:44:37,100 --> 02:44:38,060
Moss carpet, why not?

2508
02:44:39,380 --> 02:44:40,300
Some decoration?

2509
02:44:41,960 --> 02:44:42,560
Oh, no.

2510
02:44:44,720 --> 02:44:47,160
In, in, in, in.

2511
02:44:47,860 --> 02:44:48,300
Wonderful.

2512
02:44:48,440 --> 02:44:49,100
Now we block that off.

2513
02:44:49,180 --> 02:44:49,800
Never to be seen again.

2514
02:44:51,360 --> 02:44:52,860
Then, bucket.

2515
02:44:53,060 --> 02:44:54,680
And I do believe we need water first.

2516
02:44:57,540 --> 02:44:58,300
Wait, what?

2517
02:45:00,280 --> 02:45:01,240
There we go.

2518
02:45:01,540 --> 02:45:01,920
Gotcha.

2519
02:45:02,480 --> 02:45:03,660
Bucket of Axolotl.

2520
02:45:04,220 --> 02:45:05,780
Oh, wait, how did I...

2521
02:45:11,700 --> 02:45:12,980
No clue how that just happened.

2522
02:45:15,100 --> 02:45:16,120
Can I put you in here?

2523
02:45:17,060 --> 02:45:17,420
Yay!

2524
02:45:18,760 --> 02:45:21,560
Put the diamond chest... I'm never going to replace it anyway.

2525
02:45:22,040 --> 02:45:23,020
Forgot to put the wheat back.

2526
02:45:24,460 --> 02:45:25,380
Signs can go in here.

2527
02:45:27,020 --> 02:45:28,000
Crafting table is there.

2528
02:45:31,020 --> 02:45:31,540
That's good.

2529
02:45:40,940 --> 02:45:42,980
You are a zombie villager!

2530
02:45:44,140 --> 02:45:45,920
Man, why didn't I bring apple?

2531
02:45:48,800 --> 02:45:49,860
Let's make that a thing.

2532
02:45:49,960 --> 02:45:51,460
Next time I come down here, I bring apple.

2533
02:45:53,480 --> 02:45:53,960
Oh.

2534
02:45:59,460 --> 02:46:01,520
Oh, god.

2535
02:46:02,960 --> 02:46:03,940
I'm taking these.

2536
02:46:07,260 --> 02:46:11,160
The way I'm seeing it, I'm already using one slot in my inventory for it.

2537
02:46:11,300 --> 02:46:12,720
Why not just fill it with a stack, right?

2538
02:46:15,060 --> 02:46:16,420
Oh my god, axolotls!

2539
02:46:18,700 --> 02:46:19,800
Let's grab a whole family.

2540
02:46:24,120 --> 02:46:25,300
Wait, I'm not sure how this works.

2541
02:46:25,700 --> 02:46:26,340
Oh, there we go, okay.

2542
02:46:29,540 --> 02:46:30,740
Uh, you come with me now.

2543
02:46:32,080 --> 02:46:32,400
Boom!

2544
02:46:33,440 --> 02:46:34,700
Look at all these axolotls.

2545
02:46:41,080 --> 02:46:41,660
Got him.

2546
02:46:47,540 --> 02:46:50,080
Maybe we'll just take some of these blocks as well.

2547
02:46:56,880 --> 02:46:57,320
Yep.

2548
02:47:01,400 --> 02:47:03,040
This needs to go everywhere in the village.

2549
02:47:03,260 --> 02:47:04,800
I want to make really cool things.

2550
02:47:08,910 --> 02:47:10,030
Oh no.

2551
02:47:10,530 --> 02:47:11,270
The flow.

2552
02:47:25,330 --> 02:47:28,290
My arm is itchy.

2553
02:47:32,950 --> 02:47:36,050
I think this place is decently lit now.

2554
02:47:41,570 --> 02:47:43,250
Man, do I even want to take this diamond?

2555
02:47:44,910 --> 02:47:46,150
I'm swimming in diamond!

2556
02:47:47,410 --> 02:47:48,350
Don't really need it.

2557
02:47:59,600 --> 02:48:01,400
Oh, another one of these.

2558
02:48:02,820 --> 02:48:03,680
I think.

2559
02:48:05,440 --> 02:48:12,620
Is this not the... I will grab even more.

2560
02:48:14,360 --> 02:48:15,020
Wait.

2561
02:48:18,380 --> 02:48:19,060
Ah.

2562
02:48:20,840 --> 02:48:22,180
Zombie again, of course.

2563
02:48:22,540 --> 02:48:24,060
I'm not even surprised at this point.

2564
02:48:24,180 --> 02:48:25,000
Golden Apple!

2565
02:48:29,200 --> 02:48:30,180
There we go.

2566
02:48:32,360 --> 02:48:33,400
I don't want any of this.

2567
02:48:33,480 --> 02:48:34,060
I want this one.

2568
02:48:36,740 --> 02:48:37,200
Okay.

2569
02:48:42,360 --> 02:48:43,800
Stop dolphin diving, please.

2570
02:48:45,420 --> 02:48:47,380
We're not on Antarctica right now.

2571
02:48:53,440 --> 02:48:54,400
I'll just jump down.

2572
02:49:06,240 --> 02:49:07,500
So pretty down here.

2573
02:49:10,470 --> 02:49:17,310
Dude, I feel like... Speaking of mage tower... Wouldn't it be cool to have, like, enchanting in there?

2574
02:49:18,090 --> 02:49:20,590
Maybe not the most, you know, efficient.

2575
02:49:21,310 --> 02:49:24,450
But then I'm thinking we can use these blocks somehow in the construction.

2576
02:49:24,450 --> 02:49:26,230
I'm not sure how yet, but it looks very mage-y.

2577
02:49:26,390 --> 02:49:26,710
You know what I mean?

2578
02:49:27,550 --> 02:49:28,970
Very enchanting.

2579
02:49:30,190 --> 02:49:30,890
That's a word.

2580
02:49:32,490 --> 02:49:33,810
I think that could be really cool.

2581
02:49:35,330 --> 02:49:35,730
Calcite.

2582
02:49:40,390 --> 02:49:41,270
Can I reach?

2583
02:49:41,570 --> 02:49:42,290
Not quite.

2584
02:49:43,430 --> 02:49:44,310
There we go.

2585
02:49:52,840 --> 02:49:57,580
Interestingly, it feels like every one of these is giving me... What are they called again, by the way?

2586
02:49:58,280 --> 02:49:58,680
Amethysts.

2587
02:49:59,480 --> 02:50:05,000
Whereas, one of the earlier times I explored these pla- I saw that grow!

2588
02:50:06,680 --> 02:50:07,600
Okay, confirmed.

2589
02:50:07,940 --> 02:50:09,500
They are just growing like that.

2590
02:50:10,620 --> 02:50:16,140
But I was about to say, they were not grown at all, but I think maybe the fact that I've been living upstairs has made all of these grow.

2591
02:50:17,260 --> 02:50:18,180
To full size.

2592
02:50:18,990 --> 02:50:23,130
And that's why I'm getting so much down here compared to the first times I explored these places.

2593
02:50:24,030 --> 02:50:24,750
Fill it up.

2594
02:50:27,490 --> 02:50:28,410
Take it with me.

2595
02:50:29,930 --> 02:50:30,790
Put it there.

2596
02:50:31,830 --> 02:50:32,890
And keep lighting.

2597
02:50:46,270 --> 02:50:47,130
Don't look at the guy.

2598
02:51:05,910 --> 02:51:06,350
Good.

2599
02:51:06,350 --> 02:51:07,270
Maybe I should kill him.

2600
02:51:11,030 --> 02:51:11,790
Make it quick.

2601
02:51:11,970 --> 02:51:12,790
Nah, actually no.

2602
02:51:14,090 --> 02:51:16,730
Actually yes, I need his items.

2603
02:51:18,770 --> 02:51:20,390
Otherwise I'm never going to summon that dragon.

2604
02:51:29,340 --> 02:51:30,020
There.

2605
02:51:30,020 --> 02:51:31,660
So I stand here.

2606
02:51:37,380 --> 02:51:38,280
Good enough.

2607
02:51:41,160 --> 02:51:41,960
Come on.

2608
02:51:45,900 --> 02:51:46,820
Oh, come on.

2609
02:51:47,060 --> 02:51:48,020
You can reach me.

2610
02:51:51,780 --> 02:51:52,460
Okay.

2611
02:52:00,280 --> 02:52:00,960
Wonderful.

2612
02:52:01,300 --> 02:52:02,100
That was really nice.

2613
02:52:02,440 --> 02:52:03,060
Smooth.

2614
02:52:11,160 --> 02:52:12,200
Maybe not that.

2615
02:52:18,800 --> 02:52:19,480
Nope!

2616
02:52:21,160 --> 02:52:22,620
Forgot to grab the torches.

2617
02:52:24,340 --> 02:52:25,660
Let's just take two stacks.

2618
02:52:29,620 --> 02:52:31,140
Okay, where is this zombie guy?

2619
02:52:33,040 --> 02:52:33,900
I have my apple.

2620
02:52:34,020 --> 02:52:36,680
Oh, but wait, I need a potion of weakness.

2621
02:52:36,860 --> 02:52:37,320
I don't have that.

2622
02:52:39,040 --> 02:52:39,360
Fuck.

2623
02:52:40,280 --> 02:52:41,860
I'll try and give him an apple anyway.

2624
02:52:43,200 --> 02:52:45,560
I'm not quite sure why I would need to weaken it first.

2625
02:52:45,700 --> 02:52:46,640
That doesn't make any sense to me.

2626
02:52:54,620 --> 02:52:56,580
I hear you, which is a bad sign.

2627
02:52:58,200 --> 02:52:59,360
Oh, look at you, caught!

2628
02:53:08,760 --> 02:53:10,160
Oh, I can grab one more here now.

2629
02:53:11,620 --> 02:53:13,260
We're gonna have a crazy family of these.

2630
02:53:14,340 --> 02:53:14,700
Somewhere.

2631
02:53:15,680 --> 02:53:17,320
They're all gonna be super happy together.

2632
02:53:18,540 --> 02:53:19,440
So many friends.

2633
02:53:30,240 --> 02:53:31,080
There we go.

2634
02:53:32,320 --> 02:53:34,620
This should be okay now, I think.

2635
02:53:37,740 --> 02:53:39,740
Getting a lot of decoration out of this, too.

2636
02:53:41,080 --> 02:53:41,680
Wait.

2637
02:53:43,320 --> 02:53:44,120
Another one?

2638
02:53:45,780 --> 02:53:46,960
Or is that the same?

2639
02:53:51,060 --> 02:53:52,100
Holy shit!

2640
02:53:52,780 --> 02:53:53,380
Really?

2641
02:53:54,500 --> 02:53:56,540
Why can't I... Oh.

2642
02:54:08,510 --> 02:54:09,290
There you go.

2643
02:54:10,530 --> 02:54:11,350
What you looking at?

2644
02:54:17,050 --> 02:54:18,530
I'm gonna make so much tinted glass.

2645
02:54:20,110 --> 02:54:22,450
We can do crazy experiments with the tinted glass.

2646
02:54:26,730 --> 02:54:29,210
In fact, we can do experiments like... Oh!

2647
02:54:29,630 --> 02:54:36,390
We can actually turn our platform in the water into a... daytime invariant machine.

2648
02:54:40,260 --> 02:54:42,440
Yeah, it's not gonna care about that at all.

2649
02:54:54,440 --> 02:54:55,480
Gimme, gimme, gimme.

2650
02:54:58,810 --> 02:55:04,950
I came here to light caves, and instead... I'm getting all ca- Oh wait, actually.

2651
02:55:07,070 --> 02:55:08,150
Destroying these blocks?

2652
02:55:08,350 --> 02:55:08,770
Oh, shit.

2653
02:55:12,470 --> 02:55:19,950
If I do... That also breaks them normally, right?

2654
02:55:20,130 --> 02:55:20,810
Yeah, okay, okay.

2655
02:55:21,850 --> 02:55:22,830
Yeah, I'll take some of this.

2656
02:55:24,710 --> 02:55:26,870
But only the ones that don't have anything growing on them.

2657
02:55:31,150 --> 02:55:32,230
Let's get to these over here.

2658
02:55:33,950 --> 02:55:35,230
I gotta use these for...

2659
02:55:48,300 --> 02:55:50,680
Gotta be careful with my pickaxe durability as well.

2660
02:55:50,900 --> 02:55:52,160
I'm gonna leave that one, fuck it.

2661
02:55:53,780 --> 02:55:55,160
Don't need absolutely everything.

2662
02:55:57,620 --> 02:55:58,020
Nice!

2663
02:55:58,220 --> 02:55:58,800
I got a bunch.

2664
02:56:01,640 --> 02:56:02,880
Actually running out of space here.

2665
02:56:05,760 --> 02:56:07,120
What do I not need on me?

2666
02:56:13,480 --> 02:56:13,940
Mining.

2667
02:56:14,160 --> 02:56:15,060
Let's put that in mining.

2668
02:56:17,480 --> 02:56:20,620
Same as... didn't I have some iron somewhere?

2669
02:56:21,000 --> 02:56:21,640
Oh, here.

2670
02:56:27,820 --> 02:56:28,880
Some diamonds.

2671
02:56:30,920 --> 02:56:31,900
Yeah, that's good.

2672
02:56:33,400 --> 02:56:34,680
This stuff we can throw away.

2673
02:56:41,680 --> 02:56:42,760
Dip, dip, dip, dip.

2674
02:56:43,060 --> 02:56:44,100
Same as that one.

2675
02:56:45,360 --> 02:56:45,800
Yeah.

2676
02:56:46,160 --> 02:56:46,820
Very nice.

2677
02:56:52,420 --> 02:56:53,460
Almost no food left.

2678
02:56:56,120 --> 02:56:57,240
It is what it is.

2679
02:57:00,380 --> 02:57:00,820
Okay.

2680
02:57:01,200 --> 02:57:07,000
I have definitely lost my way a little bit with where I was and where I needed to go down here.

2681
02:57:11,440 --> 02:57:13,540
I think I did a decent job lighting this place.

2682
02:57:15,760 --> 02:57:20,260
Time to go back up, I think, and then go down the original... Uh-oh.

2683
02:57:22,780 --> 02:57:23,580
Hold that thought.

2684
02:57:26,160 --> 02:57:27,960
Darkness detected.

2685
02:57:29,000 --> 02:57:30,300
Must eradicate.

2686
02:57:32,820 --> 02:57:39,160
I saw another creature down here.

2687
02:57:57,850 --> 02:57:58,890
Speak to me.

2688
02:58:06,690 --> 02:58:07,650
Down here?

2689
02:58:08,770 --> 02:58:09,690
Oh yeah.

2690
02:58:13,660 --> 02:58:15,480
Actually, maybe this one links back to it.

2691
02:58:15,620 --> 02:58:16,480
Let me check this one first.

2692
02:58:18,060 --> 02:58:19,640
I also heard something over there.

2693
02:58:21,000 --> 02:58:22,380
Yeah, this is probably it, actually.

2694
02:58:24,400 --> 02:58:26,720
It's gonna loop down like that, and that's what I heard.

2695
02:58:29,940 --> 02:58:30,640
Actually, no.

2696
02:58:30,880 --> 02:58:31,360
I guess not.

2697
02:58:40,360 --> 02:58:41,260
Where does that lead?

2698
02:58:49,620 --> 02:58:50,320
Back up here.

2699
02:58:57,840 --> 02:58:58,920
But I heard enemies.

2700
02:59:01,100 --> 02:59:03,080
This could be a small cave or a big one.

2701
02:59:08,140 --> 02:59:09,600
I'm starting to think maybe it's below me.

2702
02:59:18,610 --> 02:59:19,130
Aha!

2703
02:59:21,610 --> 02:59:22,530
There we go.

2704
02:59:23,510 --> 02:59:24,710
Just going straight down.

2705
02:59:26,510 --> 02:59:27,030
Oh!

2706
02:59:27,250 --> 02:59:27,650
Zombie!

2707
02:59:30,650 --> 02:59:31,590
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

2708
02:59:33,870 --> 02:59:35,170
I got food for you!

2709
02:59:35,610 --> 02:59:36,010
Uh-oh.

2710
02:59:46,110 --> 02:59:46,970
Oh, it doesn't work.

2711
02:59:47,470 --> 02:59:49,290
Yeah, we need the potion of weakness.

2712
02:59:49,910 --> 02:59:50,330
Shit.

2713
02:59:51,770 --> 02:59:52,350
Oh, well.

2714
02:59:53,030 --> 02:59:54,350
We do that next time we go up.

2715
02:59:55,330 --> 02:59:56,010
Don't kill me.

2716
02:59:59,350 --> 03:00:00,350
Maybe I'll lock you in.

2717
03:00:03,330 --> 03:00:03,750
Boom.

2718
03:00:03,950 --> 03:00:04,750
You can't pass.

2719
03:00:05,270 --> 03:00:05,690
Maybe.

2720
03:00:10,340 --> 03:00:13,360
I mean, I'll probably never get back here, but, you know, just in case.

2721
03:00:13,920 --> 03:00:14,600
You never know.

2722
03:00:16,000 --> 03:00:18,340
Maybe I stumble on it somehow, later on.

2723
03:00:21,180 --> 03:00:21,960
I doubt it.

2724
03:00:25,800 --> 03:00:26,160
Okay.

2725
03:00:29,440 --> 03:00:33,440
If I hear lava, I don't think I care, because that's gonna be light as well, right?

2726
03:00:34,700 --> 03:00:36,120
So I don't need to care about it.

2727
03:00:41,620 --> 03:00:43,280
I'm in dire need of ascension blocks.

2728
03:00:45,360 --> 03:00:46,420
Where did I come from?

2729
03:00:46,920 --> 03:00:47,440
Was it here?

2730
03:00:47,820 --> 03:00:48,460
Yeah, it was.

2731
03:00:55,660 --> 03:00:57,140
I found that in record time.

2732
03:01:02,260 --> 03:01:03,260
Let's keep listening.

2733
03:01:04,400 --> 03:01:07,840
Now, this is where I found all that iron.

2734
03:01:14,430 --> 03:01:15,470
Why does it look like that?

2735
03:01:24,050 --> 03:01:25,370
Is this actually just the dead end?

2736
03:01:25,570 --> 03:01:26,270
Looks like it.

2737
03:01:31,470 --> 03:01:32,370
Put it up here.

2738
03:01:37,030 --> 03:01:38,250
Yeah, I'm not taking this iron.

2739
03:01:40,230 --> 03:01:40,770
Am I, though?

2740
03:01:43,450 --> 03:01:44,150
Maybe I am.

2741
03:01:53,070 --> 03:01:54,170
It is a lot of iron, right?

2742
03:01:57,550 --> 03:02:01,510
In fact, actually, I do need a lot of iron if I'm to make a beacon.

2743
03:02:02,470 --> 03:02:04,150
Like, a huge beacon, right?

2744
03:02:07,870 --> 03:02:11,130
I was thinking, I already have enough rails, but it's not just about the rails.

2745
03:02:12,870 --> 03:02:14,170
There is more at stake here.

2746
03:02:22,130 --> 03:02:22,710
That one.

2747
03:02:26,570 --> 03:02:27,890
Why is there so much iron here?

2748
03:02:32,040 --> 03:02:36,360
Like, this has to be... so freaking rare.

2749
03:02:36,960 --> 03:02:38,540
What I'm experiencing right now.

2750
03:02:40,340 --> 03:02:42,580
Even you guys must be going wow at this.

2751
03:02:47,820 --> 03:02:48,840
Take that one too.

2752
03:02:50,760 --> 03:02:53,620
Let's not forget, there was also a couple raw blocks here.

2753
03:02:56,280 --> 03:02:57,480
And stuff up here too.

2754
03:02:57,740 --> 03:02:58,660
We're not even done.

2755
03:03:06,700 --> 03:03:07,760
Now, where are you?

2756
03:03:12,460 --> 03:03:13,620
You are right here.

2757
03:03:16,740 --> 03:03:17,220
Hello.

2758
03:03:19,260 --> 03:03:20,400
But why are you here?

2759
03:03:21,120 --> 03:03:22,220
There's lots of light.

2760
03:03:22,460 --> 03:03:22,920
Oh, diamonds.

2761
03:03:25,200 --> 03:03:26,720
Okay, but there's also a bunch of darkness.

2762
03:03:29,160 --> 03:03:31,140
What the... Oh, you came from behind!

2763
03:03:32,240 --> 03:03:32,980
Holy shit.

2764
03:03:36,890 --> 03:03:38,170
Wow, you just keep coming.

2765
03:03:39,150 --> 03:03:39,810
Oh!

2766
03:03:40,490 --> 03:03:41,370
Fucking hell!

2767
03:03:41,670 --> 03:03:42,450
My shield is gone.

2768
03:03:43,930 --> 03:03:45,430
Okay, time out, time out.

2769
03:03:47,330 --> 03:03:48,430
Quickly operate.

2770
03:03:48,770 --> 03:03:49,550
We need this.

2771
03:03:50,650 --> 03:03:55,650
We need... This.

2772
03:03:56,670 --> 03:03:58,770
Then we also need wood.

2773
03:04:00,210 --> 03:04:01,150
There we go.

2774
03:04:01,410 --> 03:04:02,290
Quick and easy.

2775
03:04:04,330 --> 03:04:04,990
Okay.

2776
03:04:05,670 --> 03:04:06,830
Make some blocks.

2777
03:04:07,930 --> 03:04:08,550
Can I?

2778
03:04:08,650 --> 03:04:09,010
I can.

2779
03:04:09,710 --> 03:04:10,350
There we go.

2780
03:04:11,750 --> 03:04:12,530
Put them in there.

2781
03:04:14,590 --> 03:04:15,330
Take it back.

2782
03:04:16,190 --> 03:04:17,310
We are back in action.

2783
03:04:18,210 --> 03:04:19,010
That was fast.

2784
03:04:20,930 --> 03:04:21,990
Let's throw away crap.

2785
03:04:22,330 --> 03:04:24,290
Actually, I don't... No, no, this is... I want that.

2786
03:04:24,390 --> 03:04:24,650
I want that.

2787
03:04:25,430 --> 03:04:26,310
This I don't want.

2788
03:04:26,470 --> 03:04:27,250
That I don't want.

2789
03:04:27,550 --> 03:04:28,550
All the green stuff.

2790
03:04:29,950 --> 03:04:31,690
I actually do belong in here.

2791
03:04:38,130 --> 03:04:39,950
Throw away the moss carpet.

2792
03:04:41,090 --> 03:04:42,450
Why would I ever want that?

2793
03:04:44,190 --> 03:04:45,890
Unless I'm making a golf course.

2794
03:04:46,510 --> 03:04:47,690
Indoor golf course.

2795
03:04:48,070 --> 03:04:50,130
Then I would say that makes sense.

2796
03:04:50,730 --> 03:04:52,670
Looks like that fake grass, you know what I mean?

2797
03:04:54,410 --> 03:04:56,010
Like plastic grass.

2798
03:04:57,550 --> 03:04:59,150
Bones don't want that either.

2799
03:05:02,070 --> 03:05:05,450
And there, this is ascension, so I don't want that.

2800
03:05:12,680 --> 03:05:14,180
Okay, wonderful.

2801
03:05:25,620 --> 03:05:26,940
Look at you being trapped.

2802
03:05:32,620 --> 03:05:33,260
Wow!

2803
03:05:40,350 --> 03:05:41,990
This is a nice song as well.

2804
03:05:46,970 --> 03:05:47,610
Hello!

2805
03:05:49,270 --> 03:05:51,070
Are you stuck down there?

2806
03:05:52,350 --> 03:05:53,270
Too bad.

2807
03:05:54,850 --> 03:05:57,890
Your spawning ways and end days are over.

2808
03:05:59,910 --> 03:06:01,590
I have commanded it thus.

2809
03:06:09,690 --> 03:06:10,930
I'm so freaking lost right now.

2810
03:06:11,050 --> 03:06:11,490
Where am I?

2811
03:06:12,970 --> 03:06:14,450
This is home that way.

2812
03:06:15,810 --> 03:06:18,550
Well, I don't know where I am right now, so that's not gonna help me, actually.

2813
03:06:18,970 --> 03:06:20,310
Did I just pick up this crap again?

2814
03:06:20,490 --> 03:06:20,670
Fuck.

2815
03:06:23,870 --> 03:06:24,870
Came from here, I think?

2816
03:06:25,010 --> 03:06:25,190
Yeah.

2817
03:06:26,730 --> 03:06:27,170
Nice.

2818
03:06:29,170 --> 03:06:30,870
We float like a butterfly.

2819
03:06:33,130 --> 03:06:34,430
And we sting like a G.

2820
03:06:37,370 --> 03:06:38,630
Shit, let me up there.

2821
03:06:48,820 --> 03:06:50,580
Yeah, it's time to go back up now.

2822
03:06:53,160 --> 03:06:58,140
To the original, the OG... tunnel.

2823
03:06:58,380 --> 03:06:59,880
Well, what do you call a tunnel that's vertical?

2824
03:07:00,380 --> 03:07:01,300
Shaft, actually.

2825
03:07:01,420 --> 03:07:01,840
Yeah, shaft.

2826
03:07:03,440 --> 03:07:04,180
Mine shaft.

2827
03:07:08,580 --> 03:07:09,460
What is that?

2828
03:07:10,080 --> 03:07:11,040
I see darkness.

2829
03:07:17,260 --> 03:07:18,500
That's a bit too dark as well.

2830
03:07:18,620 --> 03:07:19,520
So much diorite here.

2831
03:07:22,340 --> 03:07:22,740
What?

2832
03:07:25,620 --> 03:07:26,580
Where have you come from?

2833
03:07:29,100 --> 03:07:31,700
Did you spawn somewhere up here and fall... Ah, I see.

2834
03:07:31,820 --> 03:07:32,280
Okay, okay.

2835
03:07:33,920 --> 03:07:34,780
I'm so smart.

2836
03:07:35,640 --> 03:07:37,000
I saw through that immediately.

2837
03:07:44,720 --> 03:07:46,540
Like a detective, I'm on the case.

2838
03:07:49,360 --> 03:07:50,500
And... case solved.

2839
03:07:55,040 --> 03:07:56,480
Now I see darkness here too.

2840
03:08:03,700 --> 03:08:08,680
That over there is a little too... is right on the border, I would say, of what I consider dark or not.

2841
03:08:23,570 --> 03:08:24,270
Same as that.

2842
03:08:29,130 --> 03:08:30,290
Ah, you bastard!

2843
03:08:31,550 --> 03:08:32,830
I'm finding so many of you!

2844
03:08:33,650 --> 03:08:35,410
Exactly when I don't have the things I need.

2845
03:08:36,290 --> 03:08:36,670
Shit.

2846
03:08:37,870 --> 03:08:38,850
Just let me get past you.

2847
03:08:43,670 --> 03:08:45,510
I wonder if there's a way to take him with me upstairs.

2848
03:08:50,250 --> 03:08:53,930
Like, how would I... take an enemy with me?

2849
03:08:58,830 --> 03:08:59,950
I'm sorry, son.

2850
03:09:00,130 --> 03:09:00,790
You had to die.

2851
03:09:01,330 --> 03:09:02,070
You cornered me.

2852
03:09:03,290 --> 03:09:05,210
I promise to save your brethren.

2853
03:09:06,370 --> 03:09:09,050
Next time, I will have the required mats.

2854
03:09:10,770 --> 03:09:13,230
For undertaking the surgery.

2855
03:09:13,650 --> 03:09:14,810
Well, it's not really surgery.

2856
03:09:15,410 --> 03:09:16,010
Transformation.

2857
03:09:20,700 --> 03:09:21,180
Up.

2858
03:09:21,420 --> 03:09:22,160
Time to go up.

2859
03:09:23,340 --> 03:09:24,320
Let's do it right here.

2860
03:09:26,420 --> 03:09:30,960
We're gonna podcast for approximately a minute and 20 seconds.

2861
03:09:35,360 --> 03:09:36,080
Actually, wait, wait.

2862
03:09:36,880 --> 03:09:37,760
I hear enemies.

2863
03:09:38,020 --> 03:09:38,460
What am I doing?

2864
03:09:43,640 --> 03:09:44,880
Are they here or above me?

2865
03:09:49,240 --> 03:09:52,200
I see a little... maybe something up there.

2866
03:09:55,080 --> 03:09:56,420
Yeah, we gotta clear that out.

2867
03:10:04,540 --> 03:10:06,100
They are right above me.

2868
03:10:11,160 --> 03:10:11,940
Look at that.

2869
03:10:12,980 --> 03:10:14,020
Fucking sussed out!

2870
03:10:19,320 --> 03:10:20,600
Detective on the case.

2871
03:10:22,880 --> 03:10:32,500
And this detective never gets drunk, never has issues with the wife, always comes home on time, always attends his daughter's place at school.

2872
03:10:32,820 --> 03:10:33,580
Oh, yeah.

2873
03:10:34,700 --> 03:10:38,140
The most well-put-together detective of all time.

2874
03:10:41,520 --> 03:10:43,260
Okay, do I hear any more enemies?

2875
03:10:43,960 --> 03:10:44,800
Maybe over here.

2876
03:10:51,120 --> 03:10:54,360
That was the worst distribution of diorite I've ever fucking done.

2877
03:10:57,200 --> 03:10:57,680
Hey!

2878
03:11:00,340 --> 03:11:01,500
Just hiding there, are you?

2879
03:11:06,760 --> 03:11:07,920
What is going on here?

2880
03:11:11,720 --> 03:11:16,820
Man, the cave system in Minecraft is insane.

2881
03:11:17,600 --> 03:11:20,080
Like, it's crisscrossing everywhere.

2882
03:11:23,870 --> 03:11:32,610
Would love to see how this actually sort of... like... some kind of overview or a map of the caves, you know what I mean?

2883
03:11:33,750 --> 03:11:35,610
Because it must look insane.

2884
03:11:38,070 --> 03:11:40,890
Wait, I see a little bit of darkness over there, but that could just be the pillar.

2885
03:11:45,400 --> 03:11:46,740
That should be fine, I think.

2886
03:11:47,280 --> 03:11:49,980
Unless something spawns right over there.

2887
03:11:50,200 --> 03:11:50,980
That could be an issue.

2888
03:11:52,000 --> 03:11:53,280
That was a horrible flight.

2889
03:11:53,980 --> 03:11:55,020
What was I thinking?

2890
03:12:04,560 --> 03:12:05,080
There.

2891
03:12:06,960 --> 03:12:07,480
Okay.

2892
03:12:08,220 --> 03:12:09,420
Continue the ascent.

2893
03:12:19,440 --> 03:12:22,220
Going a little too crazy... with the flights.

2894
03:12:25,700 --> 03:12:26,220
There we go.

2895
03:12:26,760 --> 03:12:27,660
I'm just gonna go up here.

2896
03:12:37,020 --> 03:12:38,680
Let's see how far away from home I am now.

2897
03:12:41,640 --> 03:12:44,100
By the way, I lied about the minute and 23 seconds.

2898
03:12:46,420 --> 03:12:47,880
Because I knew it wasn't gonna happen.

2899
03:12:48,200 --> 03:12:49,500
It was just a made-up number.

2900
03:12:50,580 --> 03:12:51,820
You thought I calculated that?

2901
03:12:51,880 --> 03:12:52,260
I didn't.

2902
03:12:53,000 --> 03:12:54,740
I pulled it out of my behind.

2903
03:12:58,080 --> 03:12:58,800
What are you gonna do?

2904
03:12:58,880 --> 03:12:59,200
Sue me.

2905
03:13:10,440 --> 03:13:11,380
Okay, day or night?

2906
03:13:12,720 --> 03:13:15,580
It's gonna be... Day.

2907
03:13:17,540 --> 03:13:17,980
Fuck!

2908
03:13:20,460 --> 03:13:24,000
Also, what are the chances that it was like that block I was looking at?

2909
03:13:25,740 --> 03:13:28,640
Wait, I'm actually really close to where I was before.

2910
03:13:30,700 --> 03:13:31,140
Alright.

2911
03:13:31,880 --> 03:13:32,580
Wait, it's night.

2912
03:13:32,920 --> 03:13:33,960
We can check it out now.

2913
03:13:41,990 --> 03:13:43,850
The ultimate landing, ultimate landing.

2914
03:13:46,550 --> 03:13:48,790
Oh, sweet, baby!

2915
03:13:49,830 --> 03:13:50,490
Jesus!

2916
03:13:52,430 --> 03:13:53,430
Now we wait.

2917
03:13:55,030 --> 03:13:55,690
Cheers.

2918
03:13:59,970 --> 03:14:00,810
Come on.

2919
03:14:01,210 --> 03:14:02,050
This has to work.

2920
03:14:03,750 --> 03:14:05,390
Then again, I could go further up.

2921
03:14:08,530 --> 03:14:09,730
I'm almost at the clouds.

2922
03:14:11,610 --> 03:14:12,650
Yo, actually!

2923
03:14:17,110 --> 03:14:20,270
All the clouds are always at the same distance from the ground, right?

2924
03:14:21,050 --> 03:14:24,110
It would be nice to figure out how high that actually is.

2925
03:14:27,130 --> 03:14:27,650
There?

2926
03:14:35,520 --> 03:14:37,840
Let's see if anything spawns closer to the light.

2927
03:14:40,360 --> 03:14:41,220
So what is that?

2928
03:14:41,340 --> 03:14:43,560
That is... What?

2929
03:14:43,800 --> 03:14:44,300
Oh no.

2930
03:14:45,320 --> 03:14:46,100
Oh, three of them.

2931
03:14:51,800 --> 03:14:52,300
Fuck!

2932
03:14:55,100 --> 03:14:56,260
I hate these things!

2933
03:14:57,060 --> 03:14:58,740
Alright, I'm done testing anyway.

2934
03:15:02,600 --> 03:15:03,960
God fucking damn it.

2935
03:15:04,500 --> 03:15:06,340
They always ruin the day.

2936
03:15:07,600 --> 03:15:09,320
Look how many are spawning here.

2937
03:15:10,160 --> 03:15:12,020
The interns are having trouble!

2938
03:15:13,780 --> 03:15:14,580
I'm out of here.

2939
03:15:16,760 --> 03:15:19,000
Eat the meat while I fly.

2940
03:15:23,420 --> 03:15:24,680
Oh, it's cow time!

2941
03:15:30,590 --> 03:15:36,730
One, two, three, four... Uh, Jaxter, why are you in there?

2942
03:15:39,430 --> 03:15:43,630
I just realized I can just spam because the ones I've already fed are not gonna be fed again, so I can just sort of do this.

2943
03:15:46,470 --> 03:15:47,650
Look at all that meat!

2944
03:15:48,310 --> 03:15:49,250
Producing more meat.

2945
03:15:50,250 --> 03:15:55,090
Uh, Jaxter... What do you... Oh, you know what, actually?

2946
03:15:57,690 --> 03:15:58,430
I'll take that.

2947
03:15:59,280 --> 03:16:00,440
What else can you do for me?

2948
03:16:01,620 --> 03:16:02,640
Not so much more.

2949
03:16:02,820 --> 03:16:03,500
You need to leave.

2950
03:16:07,160 --> 03:16:07,700
Thank you.

2951
03:16:08,000 --> 03:16:09,600
Why are they obsessed with being in here?

2952
03:16:10,880 --> 03:16:12,120
I actually can't stand that.

2953
03:16:14,900 --> 03:16:16,720
Like, do they have it so bad?

2954
03:16:17,460 --> 03:16:19,940
In their normal homes, they want to become like a cow?

2955
03:16:20,060 --> 03:16:20,640
I don't understand.

2956
03:16:22,520 --> 03:16:25,100
Also, I'm starting to get a feel this may be too dark right here.

2957
03:16:27,940 --> 03:16:30,120
