3498
03:45:29,230 --> 03:45:30,090
That's what you are.

3499
03:45:32,350 --> 03:45:34,490
Of course, emphasis on small.

3500
03:45:36,090 --> 03:45:41,870
I don't want to accidentally confuse Erika with Big W, who's a real piece of work.

3501
03:45:42,910 --> 03:45:44,010
Multiple children inbound.

3502
03:45:45,110 --> 03:45:45,550
Fuck.

3503
03:45:47,970 --> 03:45:48,570
I'm dying!

3504
03:45:48,710 --> 03:45:48,870
I'm dying!

3505
03:45:51,680 --> 03:45:52,800
Fucking children!

3506
03:45:53,900 --> 03:45:55,400
I'm gonna die, I'm gonna die!

3507
03:45:59,020 --> 03:45:59,860
Wow!

3508
03:46:01,240 --> 03:46:02,440
Holy crap!

3509
03:46:03,500 --> 03:46:05,420
Erika, you're not doing anything!

3510
03:46:09,940 --> 03:46:11,180
Fucking hell!

3511
03:46:14,620 --> 03:46:15,820
Goddamn children?

3512
03:46:25,120 --> 03:46:26,100
That was close.

3513
03:46:26,440 --> 03:46:28,160
And I'm level 33 as well.

3514
03:46:37,100 --> 03:46:37,660
Lighted.

3515
03:46:39,680 --> 03:46:41,100
This doesn't look very lit.

3516
03:46:41,480 --> 03:46:42,260
Not thoroughly.

3517
03:46:45,320 --> 03:46:46,700
That's way too dark over there.

3518
03:47:04,740 --> 03:47:06,720
So I've already kind of been here, I guess.

3519
03:47:08,260 --> 03:47:11,860
But I don't think I was here with the goal of actually lighting up this place.

3520
03:47:17,400 --> 03:47:19,700
Wait, yeah, I actually went in here as well.

3521
03:47:19,760 --> 03:47:20,620
Let me just double check.

3522
03:47:22,000 --> 03:47:22,960
Maybe I missed a spot.

3523
03:47:25,680 --> 03:47:27,860
So that leads to here.

3524
03:47:31,440 --> 03:47:33,820
Oh, this is that place I was in before, I think.

3525
03:47:35,220 --> 03:47:36,460
That means I already did that.

3526
03:47:36,600 --> 03:47:36,940
Wonderful.

3527
03:47:37,840 --> 03:47:38,600
Don't need to do that.

3528
03:47:39,320 --> 03:47:41,440
Slowly and surely, everything is getting lit.

3529
03:47:41,800 --> 03:47:43,740
I'm having trouble finding dark places now.

3530
03:47:44,840 --> 03:47:52,580
I think I'll have to look at the mines one more time, because that's always such an intricate network of caves that I'm bound to have missed something, right?

3531
03:47:54,820 --> 03:47:55,260
Yeah.

3532
03:47:55,960 --> 03:47:56,740
Go back there.

3533
03:48:00,840 --> 03:48:02,000
In fact, what about here?

3534
03:48:03,540 --> 03:48:04,760
What does this look like?

3535
03:48:06,660 --> 03:48:07,380
Dead end?

3536
03:48:15,080 --> 03:48:16,180
Thought I heard something.

3537
03:48:17,560 --> 03:48:18,640
Could have been Erica.

3538
03:48:18,740 --> 03:48:19,620
That's actually a problem.

3539
03:48:20,300 --> 03:48:23,740
Erica's footsteps can be mistaken for an enemy's footsteps.

3540
03:48:37,930 --> 03:48:38,610
Here we go.

3541
03:48:49,450 --> 03:48:50,790
This is still a bit too dark.

3542
03:49:11,900 --> 03:49:13,400
Are we done with the mines?

3543
03:49:14,760 --> 03:49:15,240
Possibly.

3544
03:49:18,640 --> 03:49:20,360
Time to light up this whole place.

3545
03:49:22,260 --> 03:49:24,560
This is a lot of work, isn't it?

3546
03:49:27,840 --> 03:49:30,060
This may be the largest project I've done.

3547
03:49:31,320 --> 03:49:34,820
Like, even bigger than the redstone cellar.

3548
03:49:40,450 --> 03:49:42,410
Oh, that's what that sound is.

3549
03:49:42,850 --> 03:49:44,550
I thought it was a bird flying off.

3550
03:49:45,210 --> 03:49:46,250
I kept looking back.

3551
03:49:46,390 --> 03:49:47,010
Wait, where's that bird?

3552
03:49:48,610 --> 03:49:50,670
Okay, this flow is actually super annoying.

3553
03:49:52,290 --> 03:49:53,570
That is a flow we don't want.

3554
03:49:53,730 --> 03:49:54,990
Oh god, what am I doing?

3555
03:49:57,070 --> 03:49:58,030
Oh, this flow!

3556
03:49:59,250 --> 03:50:00,070
Driving me nuts!

3557
03:50:05,000 --> 03:50:05,580
I hate it!

3558
03:50:05,660 --> 03:50:06,120
I hate the flow!

3559
03:50:08,180 --> 03:50:09,020
Oh my god!

3560
03:50:10,880 --> 03:50:12,080
What do I do?!

3561
03:50:12,080 --> 03:50:20,120
Oh no!

3562
03:50:22,180 --> 03:50:22,820
I'm gonna use wood.

3563
03:50:30,150 --> 03:50:31,070
That's fine.

3564
03:50:31,470 --> 03:50:32,270
Oh, much better.

3565
03:50:32,610 --> 03:50:33,390
Oh, we're not fine.

3566
03:50:34,850 --> 03:50:39,070
Man, nothing gives me anxiety like the flow here.

3567
03:50:39,890 --> 03:50:41,690
It is so freaking annoying.

3568
03:50:43,330 --> 03:50:43,990
Stop!

3569
03:50:44,870 --> 03:50:45,530
Okay.

3570
03:50:47,870 --> 03:50:51,850
Good grief.

3571
03:50:58,640 --> 03:51:02,120
Okay, this is a lot of delicious darkness that I get to take care of.

3572
03:51:02,460 --> 03:51:04,900
Look at all those low-hanging fruits here.

3573
03:51:05,940 --> 03:51:10,140
I just want to grab those fruits and squeeze them until the juice pops out.

3574
03:51:11,200 --> 03:51:12,040
You know what I mean?

3575
03:51:13,400 --> 03:51:17,340
See, that sentence was perfectly fine until I said, you know what I mean, at the end.

3576
03:51:17,920 --> 03:51:19,800
Crazy how that can change any sentence, right?

3577
03:51:21,080 --> 03:51:26,720
I could be like, I'm going to totally remove these railways for later, if you know what I mean.

3578
03:51:27,260 --> 03:51:33,980
See, that somehow became sexual, even though there was no connotation at all like that at first.

3579
03:51:37,420 --> 03:51:40,180
I'm just gonna start saying that in real life every time I say something.

3580
03:51:42,160 --> 03:51:46,140
I'm gonna go to the store and grab some cucumbers, if you know what I mean.

3581
03:51:50,060 --> 03:51:52,120
I'm gonna bring Erika with me on this trip.

3582
03:51:53,100 --> 03:51:53,920
Know what I mean?

3583
03:51:58,200 --> 03:51:59,420
Wait... WOAH!

3584
03:52:00,180 --> 03:52:00,700
ERIKA!

3585
03:52:03,420 --> 03:52:06,020
Did I just see a scoot fall off your body?

3586
03:52:06,440 --> 03:52:07,120
Wait, can I...?

3587
03:52:07,120 --> 03:52:09,160
Do you have, like, durability on that?

3588
03:52:09,740 --> 03:52:12,260
It almost looked like some of that scoot cracked off.

3589
03:52:20,510 --> 03:52:21,390
Alright.

3590
03:52:22,230 --> 03:52:23,670
My nose is itchy.

3591
03:52:29,320 --> 03:52:30,560
It's supposed to be a torch.

3592
03:52:30,720 --> 03:52:33,020
I don't know what's going on here.

3593
03:52:33,680 --> 03:52:35,000
Just do this.

3594
03:52:37,360 --> 03:52:38,060
Don't explode.

3595
03:52:38,380 --> 03:52:38,800
Alright, fine.

3596
03:52:38,860 --> 03:52:39,200
You can do that.

3597
03:52:39,240 --> 03:52:39,500
It's okay.

3598
03:52:40,720 --> 03:52:41,800
I actually don't care.

3599
03:52:42,480 --> 03:52:44,320
I have so much gunpowder at this point.

3600
03:52:44,360 --> 03:52:51,180
I feel like... In my quest to get infinite gunpowder, which is ultimately what this is all about, right?

3601
03:52:51,640 --> 03:52:54,940
That's what this whole idea is about.

3602
03:52:55,500 --> 03:52:56,500
I've gotten...

3603
03:52:56,560 --> 03:52:59,160
So much gunpowder, I don't even know what to do with it at this point.

3604
03:52:59,700 --> 03:53:03,840
Just by killing creepers.

3605
03:53:11,280 --> 03:53:12,920
Honestly, I like having Erika with me.

3606
03:53:13,900 --> 03:53:14,960
I feel so much safer.

3607
03:53:21,300 --> 03:53:23,620
Is this... Another one of these!

3608
03:53:23,780 --> 03:53:24,580
I don't want to do it though.

3609
03:53:26,140 --> 03:53:26,540
Nah.

3610
03:53:27,680 --> 03:53:28,420
I've had enough.

3611
03:53:31,160 --> 03:53:32,460
Don't want to be too greedy either.

3612
03:53:35,160 --> 03:53:36,280
I forgot about the mapping.

3613
03:53:39,420 --> 03:53:39,820
Damn.

3614
03:53:40,920 --> 03:53:41,740
Let's do a map.

3615
03:53:44,700 --> 03:53:45,860
Let's see what this is.

3616
03:53:49,270 --> 03:53:49,950
No way!

3617
03:53:51,110 --> 03:53:52,730
Fuck, I love the map already.

3618
03:53:53,630 --> 03:53:55,470
I know exactly where I am.

3619
03:53:55,910 --> 03:53:57,630
Holy shit, dude.

3620
03:53:59,650 --> 03:54:01,030
We're gonna make another map now?

3621
03:54:07,740 --> 03:54:09,120
Oh wait, wrong map.

3622
03:54:10,420 --> 03:54:11,020
Yep!

3623
03:54:11,280 --> 03:54:11,720
Look at that!

3624
03:54:12,500 --> 03:54:13,760
Look at that!

3625
03:54:15,300 --> 03:54:16,400
I hear skeleton.

3626
03:54:18,900 --> 03:54:21,100
Not a surprise, I guess, since there's still darkness.

3627
03:54:29,930 --> 03:54:32,490
See, now I kind of regret throwing away those cartography tables.

3628
03:54:32,610 --> 03:54:33,470
I could use one right now.

3629
03:54:33,610 --> 03:54:35,070
Oh my goodness, that is deep.

3630
03:54:39,470 --> 03:54:44,130
How am I gonna pull this one off?

3631
03:54:46,370 --> 03:54:47,690
I guess I'll just drop down.

3632
03:54:49,450 --> 03:54:50,330
Eat some cookies.

3633
03:54:51,370 --> 03:54:52,570
Get a bit of a sugar high.

3634
03:54:53,690 --> 03:54:55,450
Fuck, I could eat some cookies right now, dude.

3635
03:54:56,010 --> 03:54:57,050
I should make some again.

3636
03:55:02,880 --> 03:55:04,140
All right, Erika, stay up there.

3637
03:55:04,540 --> 03:55:06,280
I'll be back in just a moment.

3638
03:55:06,520 --> 03:55:09,900
I need to head down here and fix this darkness, and then I'll be back.

3639
03:55:10,580 --> 03:55:11,600
Don't worry, I'll be safe.

3640
03:55:15,140 --> 03:55:16,380
Erika, I told you not to come down here!

3641
03:55:16,920 --> 03:55:25,560
I swear to God, if you fall in lava, I'm gonna... I'm gonna text all your friends... something dirty.

3642
03:55:26,560 --> 03:55:28,360
So that they never want to be friends with you again.

3643
03:55:30,320 --> 03:55:30,880
Get up here.

3644
03:55:37,670 --> 03:55:38,530
That was a bit risky.

3645
03:55:46,480 --> 03:55:47,900
What is this shitty cave?

3646
03:55:48,060 --> 03:55:48,500
Look at this!

3647
03:55:49,700 --> 03:55:51,560
This is what nightmares are made of.

3648
03:55:53,140 --> 03:55:56,480
Like, a million mobs could be spawning in here, and I wouldn't know.

3649
03:55:56,760 --> 03:55:58,020
Destroying my whole operation.

3650
03:55:59,260 --> 03:55:59,740
Spider.

3651
03:55:59,940 --> 03:56:00,800
Spider detected.

3652
03:56:02,880 --> 03:56:03,360
Scanner.

3653
03:56:03,840 --> 03:56:04,320
Engage.

3654
03:56:06,700 --> 03:56:07,180
There.

3655
03:56:11,380 --> 03:56:11,860
Lights.

3656
03:56:12,940 --> 03:56:14,840
Oh, I hear a bunch of enemies here!

3657
03:56:18,060 --> 03:56:19,600
It's like a zombie party.

3658
03:56:23,080 --> 03:56:23,900
This way.

3659
03:56:25,220 --> 03:56:26,820
Are you above or below me?

3660
03:56:28,400 --> 03:56:29,440
Ah-ha!

3661
03:56:31,680 --> 03:56:33,460
Well, well, well.

3662
03:56:34,020 --> 03:56:34,540
Uh-oh.

3663
03:56:36,600 --> 03:56:37,480
Erica survived!

3664
03:56:37,900 --> 03:56:39,300
Oh, I thought she died.

3665
03:56:39,740 --> 03:56:42,040
That would have been such a disaster, mentally.

3666
03:56:46,660 --> 03:56:47,340
ERIKA!

3667
03:56:47,700 --> 03:56:48,320
Sorry!

3668
03:56:49,880 --> 03:56:51,880
Oh my god, she took two hits.

3669
03:56:52,320 --> 03:56:54,080
Two massive hits were taken.

3670
03:56:54,540 --> 03:56:55,480
Eat the cookie!

3671
03:57:02,000 --> 03:57:03,000
Can I heal you somehow?

3672
03:57:03,120 --> 03:57:03,600
Do you want a cookie?

3673
03:57:04,400 --> 03:57:05,220
You don't want a cookie.

3674
03:57:05,360 --> 03:57:06,800
Do you want... Oh, fuck.

3675
03:57:08,860 --> 03:57:09,600
Oh, wait, I'm here.

3676
03:57:10,720 --> 03:57:11,000
Oh!

3677
03:57:12,860 --> 03:57:13,440
Oh, shit.

3678
03:57:13,460 --> 03:57:14,480
I never lit this place.

3679
03:57:17,540 --> 03:57:18,180
My mistake.

3680
03:57:19,580 --> 03:57:20,480
Wait, where am I right now?

3681
03:57:20,540 --> 03:57:21,440
I don't actually know where I am.

3682
03:57:22,740 --> 03:57:23,340
Yes, I do know.

3683
03:57:23,440 --> 03:57:26,100
This is the mine I was in before, I think.

3684
03:57:27,920 --> 03:57:30,980
In any case, this is right below my house.

3685
03:57:31,420 --> 03:57:33,060
We're gonna check the map in just a second here.

3686
03:57:34,540 --> 03:57:35,920
Look at this band of misfits.

3687
03:57:37,940 --> 03:57:38,660
Get out of here.

3688
03:57:39,380 --> 03:57:40,400
Erika, don't get too close.

3689
03:57:41,320 --> 03:57:43,020
Thank god Erika cannot trigger those.

3690
03:57:48,600 --> 03:57:49,000
Okay.

3691
03:57:50,860 --> 03:57:52,960
Let's clean up this area first, then we'll look at the map.

3692
03:57:56,490 --> 03:57:58,170
That's right, be scared.

3693
03:57:59,450 --> 03:58:00,570
The children again!

3694
03:58:03,510 --> 03:58:04,170
Get him!

3695
03:58:04,930 --> 03:58:06,490
Okay, yeah, yeah, go, go, go.

3696
03:58:16,290 --> 03:58:16,850
Wonderful.

3697
03:58:22,730 --> 03:58:27,090
I just got a flashback to the one time I had the idea of making a... Oh, oh, oh, I'm dying, I'm dying.

3698
03:58:29,410 --> 03:58:29,730
Fuck!

3699
03:58:30,010 --> 03:58:30,670
Where's my food?

3700
03:58:32,670 --> 03:58:33,550
Proper food, there we go.

3701
03:58:41,110 --> 03:58:42,590
How are you not getting hit by that?

3702
03:58:49,100 --> 03:58:50,120
Oh, I saw you spawn.

3703
03:58:50,220 --> 03:58:51,480
We got to take care of this right now.

3704
03:58:51,600 --> 03:58:52,380
There's too many spawns.

3705
03:58:53,420 --> 03:58:56,600
It's like... What do you call it?

3706
03:58:58,700 --> 03:59:01,120
I cannot form English sentences at the very moment.

3707
03:59:03,040 --> 03:59:03,580
Bye-bye.

3708
03:59:09,650 --> 03:59:13,990
What the fuck is that thing called that you used to sweep dirt with under the rug?

3709
03:59:15,670 --> 03:59:19,950
It's called a... a motherfucking... OH!

3710
03:59:20,190 --> 03:59:20,910
What is it?!

3711
03:59:25,980 --> 03:59:27,580
It's made of bristles!

3712
03:59:29,120 --> 03:59:31,200
It has like a wooden stick attached!

3713
03:59:33,300 --> 03:59:34,880
Are you kidding me?!

3714
03:59:34,880 --> 03:59:38,400
I'm actually suffering from something.

3715
03:59:39,360 --> 03:59:40,400
Get away from me.

3716
03:59:45,180 --> 03:59:50,400
Erika, I know you're very eager, but you're running towards the explodey guy.

3717
03:59:51,320 --> 03:59:52,180
Oh no.

3718
03:59:53,640 --> 03:59:58,680
I cannot get over the fact that I don't know what the name for this instrument of cleaning is!

3719
04:00:02,920 --> 04:00:03,680
Okay.

3720
04:00:03,680 --> 04:00:06,660
I have no more... This is a disaster, dude.

3721
04:00:08,400 --> 04:00:09,140
Fuck off.

3722
04:00:09,860 --> 04:00:10,980
Deal with Erika.

3723
04:00:13,660 --> 04:00:15,920
I don't know if I can take this.

3724
04:00:18,680 --> 04:00:19,680
Calm down.

3725
04:00:20,680 --> 04:00:21,540
It's okay.

3726
04:00:26,090 --> 04:00:26,730
You know what?

3727
04:00:26,730 --> 04:00:28,510
I don't even know what that instrument of cleaning is called.

3728
04:00:28,850 --> 04:00:35,770
At this point, I think having that information in my brain will actually be a detriment to my success in this cave.

3729
04:00:37,010 --> 04:00:38,130
It's not gonna help me.

3730
04:00:39,130 --> 04:00:40,250
It's gonna hold me back.

3731
04:00:43,010 --> 04:00:44,170
I'm gonna go down here now.

3732
04:00:44,550 --> 04:00:45,090
Wait a minute.

3733
04:00:45,430 --> 04:00:46,430
Look at your armor!

3734
04:00:48,170 --> 04:00:50,430
It's totally... Oh, whoa!

3735
04:00:51,110 --> 04:00:53,590
I think I understand how the armor works!

3736
04:00:54,570 --> 04:00:57,090
And if I'm right, I like it!

3737
04:00:57,450 --> 04:01:00,670
It's pretty much an immunity layer.

3738
04:01:01,970 --> 04:01:06,310
Like, she can take X amount of hits where she takes no damage.

3739
04:01:06,790 --> 04:01:09,470
Then the armor is gone, and now she's vulnerable again.

3740
04:01:09,910 --> 04:01:10,930
That's what I think.

3741
04:01:11,550 --> 04:01:12,530
And you know what?

3742
04:01:13,010 --> 04:01:13,770
Love that.

3743
04:01:14,770 --> 04:01:17,390
That means I can't be worried at all.

3744
04:01:17,490 --> 04:01:18,210
I don't need to be worried.

3745
04:01:18,590 --> 04:01:19,590
She's gonna be safe.

3746
04:01:20,230 --> 04:01:22,930
As long as I see that armor on her, everything's good.

3747
04:01:24,430 --> 04:01:26,090
Also, it's called a fucking broom!

3748
04:01:27,250 --> 04:01:28,190
I remembered.

3749
04:01:30,230 --> 04:01:31,130
I remembered.

3750
04:01:32,630 --> 04:01:33,890
It's a motherfucking broom.

3751
04:01:34,210 --> 04:01:35,290
And I'm out of food.

3752
04:01:37,910 --> 04:01:38,430
Ah!

3753
04:01:40,800 --> 04:01:42,480
Why is it so stressful lighting caves?

3754
04:01:42,860 --> 04:01:43,460
Oh god.

3755
04:01:43,660 --> 04:01:44,540
I can't sprint!

3756
04:01:46,880 --> 04:01:47,900
No, don't eat those.

3757
04:01:48,160 --> 04:01:51,040
It's tempting, but we stick to cookies.

3758
04:01:53,420 --> 04:01:54,160
Armor gone.

3759
04:01:56,720 --> 04:01:57,820
It's time to head back up.

3760
04:01:58,160 --> 04:02:01,020
We gotta... We're gonna stay.

3761
04:02:03,580 --> 04:02:05,520
I just need to see what's over on this side.

3762
04:02:10,790 --> 04:02:18,650
Erika, you better not get exploded right now or I will eat you instead if I find no other source of food.

3763
04:02:18,790 --> 04:02:20,050
You will become the food source.

3764
04:02:22,510 --> 04:02:24,470
Yes, it's true, I will eat you.

3765
04:02:26,070 --> 04:02:26,770
Where's my...

3766
04:02:31,580 --> 04:02:32,060
Oh.

3767
04:02:32,060 --> 04:02:32,840
Get away!

3768
04:02:34,720 --> 04:02:36,900
No, here, here, here.

3769
04:02:37,660 --> 04:02:38,140
Boom.

3770
04:02:39,340 --> 04:02:41,440
Let's just light as much as we can, then we leave.

3771
04:02:42,720 --> 04:02:43,520
Am I hearing?

3772
04:02:43,660 --> 04:02:44,220
I am hearing.

3773
04:02:47,900 --> 04:02:48,820
Light this up.

3774
04:02:49,860 --> 04:02:50,720
Wait, I've been here?

3775
04:02:52,360 --> 04:02:54,460
The f... hell?

3776
04:02:54,680 --> 04:02:55,880
I don't remember this at all.

3777
04:03:00,170 --> 04:03:03,750
Erica, this is a little bit treacherous terrain.

3778
04:03:04,430 --> 04:03:05,110
Oh my goodness.

3779
04:03:06,450 --> 04:03:09,290
Oh, Erica, get down from there.

3780
04:03:09,450 --> 04:03:10,070
What are you doing?

3781
04:03:11,850 --> 04:03:12,870
Are you kidding?

3782
04:03:14,630 --> 04:03:15,850
Be careful now.

3783
04:03:19,750 --> 04:03:20,610
Come on.

3784
04:03:22,470 --> 04:03:24,130
Give me a heart attack.

3785
04:03:29,190 --> 04:03:29,630
Okay.

3786
04:03:29,630 --> 04:03:30,350
Keep lighting.

3787
04:03:30,530 --> 04:03:30,970
Oh yeah, look.

3788
04:03:31,450 --> 04:03:32,610
Way less enemies now.

3789
04:03:33,230 --> 04:03:34,070
So satisfying.

3790
04:03:40,490 --> 04:03:41,150
Above me.

3791
04:03:42,870 --> 04:03:43,490
Up there.

3792
04:03:43,630 --> 04:03:43,910
Oh yeah.

3793
04:03:44,150 --> 04:03:45,690
That's a prime spot for spawning.

3794
04:03:45,810 --> 04:03:46,330
I see it now.

3795
04:03:47,490 --> 04:03:48,750
Let's check the map real quick.

3796
04:03:50,530 --> 04:03:50,970
Okay.

3797
04:03:52,790 --> 04:03:54,250
That means we're not on this one either.

3798
04:03:57,850 --> 04:03:58,550
Make a new one?

3799
04:04:01,070 --> 04:04:02,470
Why did you just throw that?

3800
04:04:05,530 --> 04:04:06,610
We get rid of all this.

3801
04:04:07,410 --> 04:04:08,510
Honestly, yeah, get rid of it.

3802
04:04:09,170 --> 04:04:11,670
These two, that two, this one.

3803
04:04:16,610 --> 04:04:17,670
Oh, wait, wrong.

3804
04:04:22,160 --> 04:04:22,560
Okay.

3805
04:04:25,000 --> 04:04:25,740
Go over here.

3806
04:04:28,460 --> 04:04:29,600
This should be a new map.

3807
04:04:35,540 --> 04:04:36,240
Look at that!

3808
04:04:36,600 --> 04:04:38,620
We are right below the village!

3809
04:04:40,020 --> 04:04:43,720
So that just makes this so much more satisfying to light up now.

3810
04:04:44,560 --> 04:04:46,560
Fuckin' hell, the mapping was a genius idea.

3811
04:04:47,660 --> 04:04:49,360
I am so happy with myself.

3812
04:04:50,040 --> 04:04:50,820
So pleased.

3813
04:04:52,980 --> 04:04:58,100
Sometimes you get this fear that, oh, should I really be doing it here, you know, because is it really close and everything?

3814
04:04:58,200 --> 04:04:58,820
It's super close.

3815
04:05:00,000 --> 04:05:01,180
It's very close in this case.

3816
04:05:02,560 --> 04:05:05,000
We can also put all the maps in a basket.

3817
04:05:07,280 --> 04:05:07,800
Hey!

3818
04:05:22,790 --> 04:05:25,250
So much... so light.

3819
04:05:26,190 --> 04:05:35,210
I think I'm gonna make a time-lapse of me doing all of this cave lighting when I'm done with it, or when I think I'm done, or when I have given up on it.

3820
04:05:36,190 --> 04:05:39,790
Insert whatever situation will end up with me not doing it anymore.

3821
04:05:40,630 --> 04:05:42,150
If that ends in success or not.

3822
04:05:42,890 --> 04:05:47,250
Just to see how much I actually did, because I feel like I've been doing this forever, dude.

3823
04:05:47,990 --> 04:05:49,930
I have been doing this for so long.

3824
04:05:51,660 --> 04:05:55,700
And I have barely seen any results when I check the Orphan Crusher.

3825
04:05:56,640 --> 04:06:00,960
Like, it's barely perceptible that anything is changing at all.

3826
04:06:02,380 --> 04:06:07,740
But my experiments out in the clouds have proved that this is what to do.

3827
04:06:08,620 --> 04:06:11,660
It really has proved that, so I know I'm on the right track.

3828
04:06:12,760 --> 04:06:16,340
I just gotta be vigilant and stay the course and not falter.

3829
04:06:20,190 --> 04:06:22,670
Or maybe I'm just massively coping.

3830
04:06:22,930 --> 04:06:24,190
It's a possibility.

3831
04:06:27,530 --> 04:06:28,830
Why is there green here?

3832
04:06:31,390 --> 04:06:31,970
Ah!

3833
04:06:33,190 --> 04:06:33,770
No!

3834
04:06:34,310 --> 04:06:36,310
I thought it was a creeper spawner!

3835
04:06:36,490 --> 04:06:40,050
I saw the creeper and I saw the spawner, but it isn't.

3836
04:06:40,530 --> 04:06:40,850
Fuck!

3837
04:06:41,670 --> 04:06:43,390
The game is trolling me.

3838
04:06:44,550 --> 04:06:45,770
What the hell?

3839
04:06:47,730 --> 04:06:49,410
You cannot actually be real.

3840
04:06:49,770 --> 04:06:51,230
I thought this was it?

3841
04:06:54,240 --> 04:06:55,560
Oh, fuck you.

3842
04:06:57,640 --> 04:06:59,200
That's actually so unlucky.

3843
04:07:03,220 --> 04:07:04,920
Well, yeah, I need coals, I guess.

3844
04:07:09,820 --> 04:07:14,700
Where are you?

3845
04:07:22,800 --> 04:07:24,240
Right below or above me, I think.

3846
04:07:25,620 --> 04:07:30,440
But let me just keep going a little... Zombies... That's gotta be below me.

3847
04:07:31,880 --> 04:07:34,360
Erika, uh... You know what, Erika, come here!

3848
04:07:36,420 --> 04:07:36,960
Come to me.

3849
04:07:37,940 --> 04:07:39,420
You're gonna stand here for a bit, okay?

3850
04:07:39,520 --> 04:07:41,320
You don't have any armor, just stay back.

3851
04:07:41,620 --> 04:07:42,820
Let Dad handle this.

3852
04:07:47,760 --> 04:07:48,820
There you guys are!

3853
04:07:48,960 --> 04:07:49,720
Look at that!

3854
04:07:51,320 --> 04:07:51,760
Boom!

3855
04:07:55,720 --> 04:07:56,900
Ooh, there's a lot of you.

3856
04:08:08,960 --> 04:08:10,140
You like laughing, huh?

3857
04:08:11,720 --> 04:08:12,680
Who's laughing now?

3858
04:08:20,260 --> 04:08:21,440
Make a staircase here.

3859
04:08:29,260 --> 04:08:30,580
Just so I can get back up.

3860
04:08:41,360 --> 04:08:45,880
I'll have some of that.

3861
04:08:58,720 --> 04:08:59,700
Let's look at the map.

3862
04:09:07,240 --> 04:09:07,760
Okay.

3863
04:09:08,120 --> 04:09:09,180
I love this.

3864
04:09:09,300 --> 04:09:10,180
I love this mapping.

3865
04:09:10,440 --> 04:09:11,620
Such a great idea.

3866
04:09:14,120 --> 04:09:15,380
Let me actually see here.

3867
04:09:15,540 --> 04:09:18,380
So if this is that...

3868
04:09:22,070 --> 04:09:22,550
There.

3869
04:09:24,730 --> 04:09:26,590
That's right below it, so there.

3870
04:09:27,590 --> 04:09:33,830
Then we have this guy, which is... Oh, where is this?

3871
04:09:35,690 --> 04:09:37,210
It has to be top left.

3872
04:09:37,710 --> 04:09:38,670
It's there.

3873
04:09:40,910 --> 04:09:41,690
Bottom left.

3874
04:09:42,350 --> 04:09:44,210
I think that's the layout right now.

3875
04:09:44,330 --> 04:09:46,270
In this, like, the way I have put it into the... here.

3876
04:09:47,870 --> 04:09:48,870
This is where I am now.

3877
04:09:51,970 --> 04:09:56,310
Oh wait, so this one should be pointing... Yeah, it is, it is, it is.

3878
04:09:56,430 --> 04:09:56,550
Okay.

3879
04:09:57,110 --> 04:09:57,410
Good.

3880
04:09:58,650 --> 04:09:59,130
Wonderful.

3881
04:10:00,070 --> 04:10:03,850
Now I have validated myself in my location and my activities.

3882
04:10:04,250 --> 04:10:08,570
I can keep going, feeling confident that I'm doing God's work.

3883
04:10:10,850 --> 04:10:11,330
Shit!

3884
04:10:12,190 --> 04:10:16,950
Sometimes the arrows just like to penetrate these enemies, like, without damaging them at all.

3885
04:10:22,360 --> 04:10:23,200
Deep slate me.

3886
04:10:35,260 --> 04:10:39,380
Uh... Man, where the hell... Oh, thank god.

3887
04:10:39,560 --> 04:10:40,000
The cave ends.

3888
04:10:41,280 --> 04:10:41,720
Yes!

3889
04:10:44,960 --> 04:10:46,280
Dead ends are the best.

3890
04:10:53,520 --> 04:10:55,460
The cookies are actually sustaining me.

3891
04:10:58,220 --> 04:11:01,160
I guess I can just refrain from sprinting too much.

3892
04:11:08,300 --> 04:11:09,700
Wait, I came from here.

3893
04:11:13,480 --> 04:11:15,140
Imagine if you couldn't walk over torches.

3894
04:11:15,260 --> 04:11:15,920
That would be so annoying.

3895
04:11:16,780 --> 04:11:26,260
I'm glad they made them transparent, I guess you could say, or not collidable with the player.

3896
04:11:34,300 --> 04:11:35,220
That's way too dark.

3897
04:11:38,440 --> 04:11:39,600
Let's see where we are in the map.

3898
04:11:39,780 --> 04:11:41,220
I'm gonna have one piece of the map out.

3899
04:11:41,320 --> 04:11:41,740
Maybe this one.

3900
04:11:43,660 --> 04:11:44,340
Right below!

3901
04:11:44,600 --> 04:11:44,980
Look at that!

3902
04:11:45,260 --> 04:11:46,380
Right below the village.

3903
04:11:47,120 --> 04:11:48,360
Doesn't that feel great?

3904
04:11:53,160 --> 04:12:00,240
Maybe what I'll do is I'll do like... So on the village and then the squares around the village in terms of map here.

3905
04:12:00,360 --> 04:12:01,800
That's what I'm going to sort of clear out.

3906
04:12:03,500 --> 04:12:06,520
That way I'm at least systematic about where I do it, right?

3907
04:12:08,700 --> 04:12:10,260
And I can feel really good about it too.

3908
04:12:13,520 --> 04:12:16,080
Man, the mapping really just changed me right now.

3909
04:12:16,240 --> 04:12:17,140
I feel so much better.

3910
04:12:23,780 --> 04:12:37,380
It's almost like, you know, when you're studying for an exam and you have some previous exams from some of the other years, you know, where they have problems on them that could be similar to the ones you're probably going to get.

3911
04:12:38,180 --> 04:12:47,340
When you don't have solutions for them and you've never done a problem like that before, you don't really know if you've arrived at something that makes sense other than your intuition and logical thinking, right?

3912
04:12:47,800 --> 04:12:50,820
But having like a... what do you call it?

3913
04:12:53,420 --> 04:12:54,500
What did I just say?

3914
04:12:55,300 --> 04:12:56,220
Like the results?

3915
04:12:57,080 --> 04:13:01,360
So you do the problem first and you can verify whether or not you're on the right track, you know?

3916
04:13:01,560 --> 04:13:02,700
I feel the same way here.

3917
04:13:03,040 --> 04:13:05,940
That all the work I'm doing here is not in vain, so to speak.

3918
04:13:06,340 --> 04:13:07,340
I know I'm doing God's work!

3919
04:13:07,960 --> 04:13:09,340
Why did I have to jump on that?

3920
04:13:11,560 --> 04:13:11,960
Fuck.

3921
04:13:14,080 --> 04:13:20,960
I always hated doing practice problems for new stuff when I didn't know the solution I arrived at was correct or not, you know?

3922
04:13:21,640 --> 04:13:23,380
I mean, sometimes you can intuit it, you know.

3923
04:13:24,260 --> 04:13:25,560
But sometimes you can't.

3924
04:13:29,780 --> 04:13:30,180
Torches.

3925
04:13:30,920 --> 04:13:32,160
Oh, didn't mean to do that, Erika.

3926
04:13:33,540 --> 04:13:34,740
Two stacks of torches left.

3927
04:13:38,740 --> 04:13:39,780
Sure you don't want a cookie?

3928
04:13:40,380 --> 04:13:41,040
They're tasty.

3929
04:13:44,140 --> 04:13:44,820
All right, then.

3930
04:13:45,160 --> 04:13:46,080
Maybe you'll eat it later.

3931
04:13:49,560 --> 04:13:51,360
See, I think this right here is too dark.

3932
04:13:52,860 --> 04:13:54,680
Same as that spot right there.

3933
04:13:55,220 --> 04:13:56,740
I could see something spawning there.

3934
04:13:57,080 --> 04:13:57,660
Same as over there.

3935
04:14:00,040 --> 04:14:03,660
Let's just give it a quick do-over.

3936
04:14:04,260 --> 04:14:04,700
Boop.

3937
04:14:06,100 --> 04:14:07,140
And then right up here.

3938
04:14:10,380 --> 04:14:11,300
And now we're good.

3939
04:14:14,320 --> 04:14:15,620
This may be too dark as well.

3940
04:14:24,640 --> 04:14:25,660
Wait, where'd you come from?

3941
04:14:26,640 --> 04:14:27,420
Oh, no.

3942
04:14:29,000 --> 04:14:30,940
You must have spawned really close.

3943
04:14:31,440 --> 04:14:31,800
Here?

3944
04:14:32,900 --> 04:14:33,920
Oh, maybe up there.

3945
04:14:43,120 --> 04:14:45,240
Did you spawn somewhere up and then fall down?

3946
04:14:48,040 --> 04:14:49,540
This is a possibility, I guess.

3947
04:14:50,800 --> 04:14:51,840
Okay, so you came from there.

3948
04:14:51,920 --> 04:14:52,920
You spawned up there, for sure.

3949
04:15:03,300 --> 04:15:03,940
Heal me.

3950
04:15:06,860 --> 04:15:07,660
Look at that!

3951
04:15:08,160 --> 04:15:09,600
Interns are at work.

3952
04:15:10,440 --> 04:15:12,800
It's running out of spots to spawn at.

3953
04:15:15,340 --> 04:15:16,540
There's so many there.

3954
04:15:39,660 --> 04:15:40,180
Nice.

3955
04:15:40,180 --> 04:15:45,700
I can confidently say that if Erika didn't have that wolf armor on, she would have been dead by now.

3956
04:15:57,300 --> 04:15:59,980
Look at all the torches, dude!

3957
04:16:00,880 --> 04:16:01,400
Wow.

3958
04:16:04,440 --> 04:16:08,540
I have not forgotten about the enemies stacked over there in the corner just before.

3959
04:16:08,720 --> 04:16:09,600
I will go and kill them.

3960
04:16:11,100 --> 04:16:12,740
I just wanted to check this real fast.

3961
04:16:13,320 --> 04:16:15,120
See, that looks a little sus down there.

3962
04:16:16,600 --> 04:16:18,680
See, I missed one spot, and where is everybody?

3963
04:16:20,780 --> 04:16:21,740
Everyone is over there.

3964
04:16:25,620 --> 04:16:28,020
Let's just plink away at them from a distance.

3965
04:16:38,630 --> 04:16:39,690
Oh my god, I'm terrible.

3966
04:16:40,450 --> 04:16:41,210
There we go.

3967
04:16:50,310 --> 04:16:51,450
Try to thread the needle.

3968
04:16:56,930 --> 04:17:02,410
The trick is to be close enough to not let them respawn, but far enough to not let them aggro you.

3969
04:17:07,180 --> 04:17:14,900
So that means I gotta be further away than 25-ish blocks.

3970
04:17:16,160 --> 04:17:19,300
Which is like... Maybe I should develop an intuition for how much that is.

3971
04:17:20,880 --> 04:17:22,280
Like 25 blocks.

3972
04:17:22,520 --> 04:17:23,380
It's not that much.

3973
04:17:26,100 --> 04:17:27,220
Oh, look at this!

3974
04:17:27,480 --> 04:17:29,160
Ooh, a little... Oh, wow!

3975
04:17:29,560 --> 04:17:31,180
You're shooting fiery arrows!

3976
04:17:31,760 --> 04:17:32,860
What the hell, dude?

3977
04:17:36,810 --> 04:17:37,450
That's cool.

3978
04:17:48,630 --> 04:17:49,590
Have I been in here?

3979
04:17:50,670 --> 04:17:51,430
Seems like it.

3980
04:17:58,790 --> 04:17:59,590
Let's get back up.

3981
04:17:59,710 --> 04:18:00,050
Oh, see?

3982
04:18:00,170 --> 04:18:02,910
They're spawning now on the... on the mines.

3983
04:18:06,040 --> 04:18:10,160
And right now, I'm still precisely below the village.

3984
04:18:11,480 --> 04:18:12,740
I see diamonds.

3985
04:18:15,600 --> 04:18:16,520
I can go for that.

3986
04:18:19,320 --> 04:18:20,660
I see a bunch of darkness.

3987
04:18:20,960 --> 04:18:22,460
Oh, yeah, look at all this.

3988
04:18:22,680 --> 04:18:23,520
It needs to be fixed as well.

3989
04:18:36,440 --> 04:18:37,680
Uh-oh.

3990
04:18:40,020 --> 04:18:41,260
No!

3991
04:18:42,700 --> 04:18:44,380
Jesus Christ!

3992
04:18:49,220 --> 04:18:50,720
Fucking hell.

3993
04:18:57,840 --> 04:18:59,080
Yeah!

3994
04:18:59,480 --> 04:19:00,100
Please!

3995
04:19:00,280 --> 04:19:00,540
Please!

3996
04:19:07,570 --> 04:19:08,790
Just get rid of it.

3997
04:19:08,950 --> 04:19:09,890
I'll collect that later.

3998
04:19:10,270 --> 04:19:10,510
Maybe not.

3999
04:19:20,230 --> 04:19:20,710
There.

4000
04:19:21,230 --> 04:19:21,710
Hey!

4001
04:19:22,310 --> 04:19:23,130
What the hell?

4002
04:19:25,230 --> 04:19:26,210
What's going on here?

4003
04:19:30,270 --> 04:19:31,350
Alright, I'll take that.

4004
04:19:35,020 --> 04:19:39,420
Man, you can really tell how bad these cookies are compared to meat.

4005
04:19:39,580 --> 04:19:42,540
They're just not, you know, filling me up at all.

4006
04:19:48,890 --> 04:19:53,050
Like, I'm not sure what the word I would use for that sort of system is.

4007
04:19:53,930 --> 04:19:56,190
Where the effect sort of lingers on me.

4008
04:19:57,730 --> 04:19:59,030
The fullness lingers.

4009
04:19:59,350 --> 04:19:59,770
You know what I mean?

4010
04:20:01,790 --> 04:20:02,890
Do I have any other food?

4011
04:20:03,050 --> 04:20:04,890
I have golden apples, but I'm saving those.

4012
04:20:10,290 --> 04:20:11,070
Just let it heal.

4013
04:20:11,190 --> 04:20:11,590
Don't sprint.

4014
04:20:12,350 --> 04:20:15,090
Just slowly heal, and we're gonna walk around.

4015
04:20:17,410 --> 04:20:20,190
Oh, that's... Oh, the flow is gonna fuck me in the ass.

4016
04:20:22,130 --> 04:20:22,830
I hate it.

4017
04:20:23,190 --> 04:20:24,310
We gotta take care of it.

4018
04:20:28,150 --> 04:20:28,510
Okay.

4019
04:20:28,810 --> 04:20:29,970
Oh, I feel so much better already.

4020
04:20:30,090 --> 04:20:33,010
That was, like, anxiety waiting to happen.

4021
04:20:36,440 --> 04:20:37,160
Goddamn flow.

4022
04:20:38,380 --> 04:20:39,820
It's gonna be the end of me one day.

4023
04:20:43,280 --> 04:20:44,740
Ooh, I'm hearing a lot of enemies.

4024
04:20:50,080 --> 04:20:50,500
Where?

4025
04:20:53,220 --> 04:20:53,640
Here.

4026
04:20:54,140 --> 04:20:54,500
Oh!

4027
04:20:57,200 --> 04:20:57,960
Perfectly located.

4028
04:21:00,760 --> 04:21:02,980
Why are you just spawning in a little cubby like this?

4029
04:21:19,290 --> 04:21:20,770
Oh wait, I had the torches out already.

4030
04:21:21,490 --> 04:21:21,850
There.

4031
04:21:28,670 --> 04:21:29,750
I think that's a dead end.

4032
04:21:30,990 --> 04:21:31,510
It's not.

4033
04:21:31,670 --> 04:21:32,550
Ooh, good thing I checked.

4034
04:21:34,350 --> 04:21:35,630
Oh, you bastard.

4035
04:21:36,310 --> 04:21:38,070
Come on, approach me, approach me.

4036
04:21:38,830 --> 04:21:39,970
Yeah, come on, get to me.

4037
04:21:40,430 --> 04:21:41,670
I know you want to jump down.

4038
04:21:42,730 --> 04:21:43,310
Jump down.

4039
04:21:46,930 --> 04:21:47,370
No?

4040
04:21:47,730 --> 04:21:49,730
Are you smart enough to know not to jump in the lava?

4041
04:21:50,210 --> 04:21:51,330
I cannot believe it.

4042
04:22:18,810 --> 04:22:19,330
Sweet.

4043
04:22:22,690 --> 04:22:23,890
That was really well done.

4044
04:22:25,190 --> 04:22:27,510
If I can, uh, praise myself a little bit.

4045
04:22:29,990 --> 04:22:30,770
Oh no.

4046
04:22:33,410 --> 04:22:34,190
There's more.

4047
04:22:38,930 --> 04:22:39,890
It's never-ending.

4048
04:22:54,170 --> 04:22:55,710
Am I still right below my house?

4049
04:22:57,290 --> 04:22:57,970
I am.

4050
04:22:58,750 --> 04:22:59,450
I am.

4051
04:23:00,690 --> 04:23:01,170
Right.

4052
04:23:01,350 --> 04:23:02,110
In fact, yeah.

4053
04:23:02,370 --> 04:23:03,010
Yeah, I am.

4054
04:23:05,050 --> 04:23:06,170
Wait a minute, actually.

4055
04:23:08,810 --> 04:23:14,110
How many blocks... I wonder if this map right here... How many blocks across that is?

4056
04:23:16,250 --> 04:23:18,250
I think that could be interesting to check.

4057
04:23:19,090 --> 04:23:21,010
Because if I know that...

4058
04:23:21,180 --> 04:23:25,680
Then I can essentially map out exactly the distance I need, at least, like, horizontally.

4059
04:23:28,080 --> 04:23:38,020
But I guess that's only really at the surface, because the sphere sort of, you know, bends inward as you go down, so... it's gonna not matter as much the further down you go, that horizontal distance.

4060
04:23:41,940 --> 04:23:43,280
I see things up there.

4061
04:23:50,420 --> 04:23:53,080
What a mess this cave is right here.

4062
04:23:53,980 --> 04:23:55,180
Absolutely disgusting.

4063
04:23:56,880 --> 04:23:58,920
Lava and little crevices everywhere.

4064
04:23:59,400 --> 04:24:01,460
Little nooks, crannies.

4065
04:24:02,280 --> 04:24:03,580
Gushing grannies.

4066
04:24:05,960 --> 04:24:07,400
Fuck, where is that from?

4067
04:24:08,060 --> 04:24:09,740
I'm trying to remember where I heard that.

4068
04:24:11,040 --> 04:24:12,700
It's a word from something.

4069
04:24:17,790 --> 04:24:18,830
Maybe a YouTube video.

4070
04:24:19,630 --> 04:24:20,630
That's the last cookie!

4071
04:24:20,930 --> 04:24:22,010
Fuck, we're out of food.

4072
04:24:24,670 --> 04:24:28,770
The best part about having the map is I can pretty much calculate exactly where I'm gonna appear.

4073
04:24:31,670 --> 04:24:33,710
If I want to dig out, you know?

4074
04:24:35,410 --> 04:24:36,410
I don't want to dig out here.

4075
04:24:36,490 --> 04:24:37,590
I'm going to appear right in my house.

4076
04:24:38,470 --> 04:24:39,450
That's a bad idea.

4077
04:24:41,130 --> 04:24:42,170
But maybe here.

4078
04:24:42,810 --> 04:24:44,510
Actually, maybe right outside the house here.

4079
04:24:45,250 --> 04:24:46,130
Outside the wall.

4080
04:24:47,110 --> 04:24:48,170
Be a nice spot.

4081
04:24:51,430 --> 04:24:52,270
Like, here.

4082
04:24:52,870 --> 04:24:53,550
I've decided.

4083
04:24:53,790 --> 04:24:54,210
This is it.

4084
04:25:00,900 --> 04:25:01,300
Podcasting.

4085
04:25:12,900 --> 04:25:13,560
Oh, shit.

4086
04:25:15,360 --> 04:25:16,540
I'm actually not surprised.

4087
04:25:16,760 --> 04:25:18,440
This is expected.

4088
04:25:23,740 --> 04:25:25,020
Do we want to keep going up?

4089
04:25:25,120 --> 04:25:25,560
I think so.

4090
04:25:31,870 --> 04:25:35,350
I am embarrassingly out of food here.

4091
04:25:37,930 --> 04:25:38,770
Yeah, that's good enough.

4092
04:25:39,250 --> 04:25:40,570
We dig here for sure.

4093
04:25:40,990 --> 04:25:42,730
But I can get further up before I go out.

4094
04:25:47,290 --> 04:25:48,250
Oh god, oh god.

4095
04:25:49,550 --> 04:25:50,330
Okay, that's fine.

4096
04:25:55,330 --> 04:25:56,370
Why am I hearing enemies?

4097
04:26:05,290 --> 04:26:08,270
Let me place the remaining torches, then I leave.

4098
04:26:09,250 --> 04:26:09,690
Yeah.

4099
04:26:10,710 --> 04:26:11,750
Let's do that.

4100
04:26:13,810 --> 04:26:16,910
I'm going to squeeze every bit out of this expedition.

4101
04:26:21,710 --> 04:26:23,190
30 torches to go.

4102
04:26:30,500 --> 04:26:32,980
I think this is a bad idea, what I'm about to do.

4103
04:26:33,820 --> 04:26:34,240
Oh!

4104
04:26:37,560 --> 04:26:37,980
Huh?

4105
04:26:39,300 --> 04:26:39,900
Uh-oh.

4106
04:26:41,180 --> 04:26:43,460
Why am I going towards the scary stuff?

4107
04:26:45,860 --> 04:26:47,080
This is a bad idea.

4108
04:26:47,200 --> 04:26:47,720
What am I doing?

4109
04:26:49,500 --> 04:26:50,440
Light it, light it!

4110
04:26:51,360 --> 04:26:53,040
Okay, it should not spawn anything anymore.

4111
04:26:55,720 --> 04:26:56,540
Should be fine.

4112
04:26:57,120 --> 04:26:57,960
Uh-oh, not children!

4113
04:26:58,930 --> 04:26:59,790
Okay, you fall down.

4114
04:27:02,880 --> 04:27:05,800
It feels so wrong, all of this, but it also feels so right.

4115
04:27:06,600 --> 04:27:07,360
Know what I mean?

4116
04:27:09,740 --> 04:27:10,440
Uh-oh.

4117
04:27:10,960 --> 04:27:11,960
See, where did you come from?

4118
04:27:12,600 --> 04:27:13,860
I don't see any darkness.

4119
04:27:15,540 --> 04:27:16,780
Maybe I see a bit, actually.

4120
04:27:16,960 --> 04:27:17,300
Right here?

4121
04:27:19,840 --> 04:27:21,100
Oh, you as well!

4122
04:27:21,940 --> 04:27:22,380
Oh!

4123
04:27:23,600 --> 04:27:24,600
I think I understand.

4124
04:27:26,560 --> 04:27:28,080
Are you coming from down here?

4125
04:27:28,480 --> 04:27:28,920
Downtown?

4126
04:27:34,560 --> 04:27:35,980
That looks downtown to me.

4127
04:27:36,120 --> 04:27:36,480
What is that?

4128
04:27:36,680 --> 04:27:37,160
A skeleton?

4129
04:27:40,240 --> 04:27:41,740
Actually, it's not a skeleton, guys.

4130
04:27:42,940 --> 04:27:44,060
It's not a skeleton.

4131
04:27:44,700 --> 04:27:46,660
It looked like a fucking skeleton!

4132
04:27:54,460 --> 04:27:55,800
Maybe I need my eyes checked.

4133
04:28:00,610 --> 04:28:01,490
Back in the mines.

4134
04:28:02,670 --> 04:28:03,970
And I've already been down there.

4135
04:28:05,870 --> 04:28:07,210
16 torches to go.

4136
04:28:08,770 --> 04:28:09,850
Now say it with me.

4137
04:28:10,030 --> 04:28:10,810
We hate the flow.

4138
04:28:14,750 --> 04:28:15,810
I want to go higher up.

4139
04:28:19,930 --> 04:28:21,110
I don't want to go higher up.

4140
04:28:21,210 --> 04:28:21,710
I want to go back.

4141
04:28:23,190 --> 04:28:24,290
Take me out of here.

4142
04:28:30,260 --> 04:28:31,440
So I've been down there.

4143
04:28:37,020 --> 04:28:38,400
Yeah, let's go where we came from.

4144
04:28:49,710 --> 04:28:51,770
There was also an enemy spawning over here somewhere.

4145
04:28:52,530 --> 04:28:55,150
No, this could maybe be too dark.

4146
04:28:56,730 --> 04:28:57,890
Down there, of course.

4147
04:29:00,710 --> 04:29:02,010
This is way too dark.

4148
04:29:07,690 --> 04:29:09,110
Not to mention this platform.

4149
04:29:18,510 --> 04:29:19,790
And over here as well.

4150
04:29:22,030 --> 04:29:23,410
Yeah, I see a spider over there.

4151
04:29:25,370 --> 04:29:26,510
This is way too dark.

4152
04:29:26,630 --> 04:29:27,550
What the hell was I thinking?

4153
04:29:57,920 --> 04:29:59,520
That should be fine.

4154
04:30:01,120 --> 04:30:02,200
One torch left.

4155
04:30:05,920 --> 04:30:06,520
There.

4156
04:30:06,820 --> 04:30:07,700
And now we leave.

4157
04:30:08,320 --> 04:30:09,780
That was the last torch.

4158
04:30:11,900 --> 04:30:13,520
I'm gonna get this experience first, though.

4159
04:30:16,330 --> 04:30:17,790
Now, level 36!

4160
04:30:18,190 --> 04:30:18,710
That's nuts!

4161
04:30:19,330 --> 04:30:20,810
Would be a shame to die now.

4162
04:30:22,610 --> 04:30:23,710
Where am I on the map?

4163
04:30:26,290 --> 04:30:27,590
Okay, looks good enough.

4164
04:30:30,490 --> 04:30:31,210
Let's head out.

4165
04:30:36,450 --> 04:30:38,350
I'm gonna go out right here.

4166
04:30:42,110 --> 04:30:42,590
Here.

4167
04:30:43,430 --> 04:30:44,290
This is the spot.

4168
04:30:47,180 --> 04:30:49,520
Okay, guys, you know the drill.

4169
04:30:50,220 --> 04:30:51,200
D or N?

4170
04:30:52,460 --> 04:30:57,800
Or is it perhaps a Q?

4171
04:30:59,080 --> 04:31:00,380
D, N, or Q?

4172
04:31:01,980 --> 04:31:03,440
It's not a trick question.

4173
04:31:11,280 --> 04:31:12,200
Oh, thank god.

4174
04:31:12,380 --> 04:31:14,040
I was like, is this another whole cave I didn't light?

4175
04:31:14,460 --> 04:31:15,220
Ooh, wait, I see.

4176
04:31:15,460 --> 04:31:16,260
We have issues.

4177
04:31:17,520 --> 04:31:20,280
There's a spot right here that is not lighted up there.

4178
04:31:20,440 --> 04:31:21,380
That needs to be fixed.

4179
04:31:22,160 --> 04:31:23,440
I need to keep going up.

4180
04:31:24,420 --> 04:31:25,660
Do I have enough to ascend?

4181
04:31:25,780 --> 04:31:26,460
I don't have enough.

4182
04:31:27,560 --> 04:31:27,980
Crap.

4183
04:31:30,120 --> 04:31:32,080
What is the best way to do this?

4184
04:31:33,820 --> 04:31:35,280
I'm just gonna dig through here.

4185
04:31:37,440 --> 04:31:38,140
Straight up.

4186
04:31:38,640 --> 04:31:39,520
It's gonna take a bit.

4187
04:31:41,200 --> 04:31:41,860
That's all right.

4188
04:31:50,160 --> 04:31:55,600
Also, I am so prepared to place an emergency block in case I dig into lava or something.

4189
04:31:57,180 --> 04:32:02,520
It may seem like I'm doing this, you know, willy-nilly without any worry for the consequences.

4190
04:32:02,820 --> 04:32:05,380
But trust me, they weigh heavily on my mind.

4191
04:32:06,000 --> 04:32:07,820
In fact, it's everything I think about.

4192
04:32:08,700 --> 04:32:12,600
So they never come and tell me that I don't play safe.

4193
04:32:14,180 --> 04:32:17,880
The fact that I'm preparing myself mentally makes this as safe as it can be.

4194
04:32:18,720 --> 04:32:20,420
There's actually not a better way to play this.

4195
04:32:27,280 --> 04:32:30,240
Knowledge is more important than anything else, right?

4196
04:32:35,600 --> 04:32:36,380
I hear enemies.

4197
04:32:36,540 --> 04:32:36,920
This is bad.

4198
04:32:37,000 --> 04:32:38,780
I need to dig the same way down that I came up.

4199
04:32:41,700 --> 04:32:42,940
Lots of things to clear out.

4200
04:32:56,570 --> 04:33:03,150
I'm gonna say... It's night.

4201
04:33:03,670 --> 04:33:04,550
It's night.

4202
04:33:16,690 --> 04:33:17,070
Hey!

4203
04:33:18,030 --> 04:33:20,750
I told you I was good at this prediction game.

4204
04:33:22,550 --> 04:33:25,270
Actually, maybe I didn't tell you, but I thought it, okay?

4205
04:33:26,970 --> 04:33:27,350
Andesite?

4206
04:33:27,510 --> 04:33:28,990
Let's make a little andesite pillar.

4207
04:33:31,250 --> 04:33:32,630
And I am very close to home.

4208
04:33:34,790 --> 04:33:35,690
Just as we planned.

4209
04:33:39,480 --> 04:33:40,580
Look at all the cows!

4210
04:33:41,280 --> 04:33:42,000
What's up, cows?

4211
04:33:44,200 --> 04:33:45,200
Time to feed!

4212
04:33:47,540 --> 04:33:48,320
Oh, look at them!

4213
04:33:48,400 --> 04:33:50,500
They're stacking on top of each other because they're so excited!

4214
04:33:52,340 --> 04:33:52,960
Wait a minute!

4215
04:33:53,220 --> 04:33:54,200
Are you crowd surfing?

4216
04:33:54,360 --> 04:33:54,580
What's that?

4217
04:33:54,880 --> 04:33:55,840
Oh, wait, I see.

4218
04:33:55,960 --> 04:33:56,580
You're on the block.

4219
04:33:56,720 --> 04:33:57,120
I get it.

4220
04:33:58,440 --> 04:33:59,540
I get it, I get it.

4221
04:34:00,900 --> 04:34:02,380
I thought he was crowd surfing.

4222
04:34:03,820 --> 04:34:05,100
Make babies for me!

4223
04:34:07,380 --> 04:34:08,580
Who else wants some?

4224
04:34:09,780 --> 04:34:10,900
Has everyone gotten?

4225
04:34:12,400 --> 04:34:12,920
Huh?

4226
04:34:13,680 --> 04:34:14,660
I think so.

4227
04:34:17,560 --> 04:34:18,880
Alright, I think I got them all.

4228
04:34:21,080 --> 04:34:23,600
How the hell did I miss them following my weed?

4229
04:34:24,300 --> 04:34:26,140
It's like so obvious.

4230
04:34:29,800 --> 04:34:30,880
Close that off for a minute.

4231
04:34:33,340 --> 04:34:37,360
Okay, now we have to seriously re-evaluate life choices.

4232
04:34:39,040 --> 04:34:43,680
Because I desperately need a lot of food.

4233
04:34:45,220 --> 04:34:46,200
And I need to enchant.

4234
04:34:47,480 --> 04:34:49,060
We're fooding, we're enchanting.

4235
04:34:50,100 --> 04:34:51,340
But we're doing it after a break.

4236
04:34:51,400 --> 04:34:52,400
I'm going to take a break real quick.

4237
04:34:52,580 --> 04:34:53,880
I'll be back in like five minutes.
